immer, uncovered, for 20 to 25 minutes or until thickened. Remove from heat; discard bay leaf.', 'Meanwhile, cook pasta according to package directions; drain. Rinse shells in cold water.', 'For filling: In a medium mixing bowl, stir together eggs, half of the mozzarella, the ricotta cheese, Parmesan cheese, parsley, the 1/2 teaspoon oregano, and the dash of pepper. Spoon filling into manicotti.', 'Pour half of the tomato mixture into a 2-quart rectangular baking dish. Arrange stuffed manicotti in the baking dish. Pour remaining sauce over shells. sprinkle remaining mozzarella cheese atop.', 'Bake the stuffed manicotti, covered, in a 350 degree F oven for 35 to 40 minutes or until heated through.', 'Make-Ahead Tip: Prepare as above, except do not bake. cover and chill in the refrigerator for up to 24 hours. Bake as above.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 249.7, \"FatContent\": 17.2, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 9.3, \"CholesterolContent\": 104.0, \"SodiumContent\": 482.1, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 8.1, \"FiberContent\": 1.4, \"SugarContent\": 3.9, \"ProteinContent\": 16.4, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT50M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT40M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H30M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 50.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 90.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['onion', 'garlic clove', 'olive oil', 'tomatoes', 'tomato sauce', 'sugar', 'dried oregano', 'dried thyme', 'bay leaf', 'eggs', 'mozzarella cheese', 'ricotta cheese', 'parmesan cheese', 'fresh parsley', 'dried oregano', 'ground black pepper']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['onion', 'garlic clove', 'olive oil', 'tomatoes', 'tomato sauce', 'sugar', 'dried oregano', 'dried thyme', 'bay leaf', 'eggs', 'mozzarella cheese', 'ricotta cheese', 'parmesan cheese', 'fresh parsley', 'dried oregano', 'ground black pepper']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['onion', 'garlic', 'olive oil', 'tomato', 'tomato sauce', 'sugar', 'oregano', 'thyme'