chokes, cut side up, to a platter; top with lemon slice& garlic and sprinkle with salt to taste. Drizzle artichokes with pan drippings; or add butter and lemon juice. Serve hot or at room temperature.']\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/89/19/0/picnPFDv7.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/89/19/0/picotSF89.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 16.0, \"Calories\": 193.5, \"FatContent\": 13.8, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 1.9, \"CholesterolContent\": 0.0, \"SodiumContent\": 122.1, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 17.0, \"FiberContent\": 7.6, \"SugarContent\": 1.7, \"ProteinContent\": 4.8, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT50M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H5M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 50.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 65.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['artichoke', 'olive oil', 'dried thyme', 'lemons', 'garlic cloves', 'salt']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['artichoke', 'olive oil', 'dried thyme', 'lemons', 'garlic cloves', 'salt']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['artichoke', 'olive oil', 'thyme', 'lemon', 'garlic', 'salt']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['artichoke', 'olive oil', 'thyme', 'lemon', 'garlic', 'salt']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['artichoke', 'olive oil', 'thyme', 'lemon', 'garlic', 'salt']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['artichoke', 'olive oil', 'thyme', 'lemon', 'garlic', 'salt']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 124.2, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 17.099999999999998, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 68.0, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 19.2, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 8.83720930232558, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 64.18604651162791, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Score\": 2, \"WHO_Healthy\": true, \"Energy_kJ\": 809.604, \"A_score\": 4, \"C_score\": 7, \"FSA_Score\": -3, \"FSA_