O_Healthy\": false, \"Energy_kJ\": 1256.8736, \"A_score\": 17, \"C_score\": 9, \"FSA_Score\": 8, \"FSA_Healthy\": false, \"popularity_score\": 0.0, \"ID\": \"323787_foodcom\", \"WHO_binary\": false, \"FSA_binary\": false, \"FSA_binned\": 1, \"popularity_log\": 0.0, \"cluster\": \"1\", \"pca1\": 0.09530123863898962, \"pca2\": -0.7683773724417927, \"protein_kcal\": 114.4, \"fat_kcal\": 145.79999999999998, \"carb_kcal\": 47.2, \"protein_pct\": 37.215354586857515, \"fat_pct\": 47.430058555627845, \"net_carb_pct\": 15.35458685751464, \"satiety_score_raw\": 34.382038826609595, \"satiety\": 27.54933188716266, \"nutrient_density_raw\": 14.555446183595123, \"nutrient_density\": 51.05575814910067}, {\"RecipeId\": 355345, \"Name\": \"Salmon &amp; Crab Loaf\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['Heat oven to 350 deg F/180 deg Celsius.', 'Toss the butternut with the oil, then roast until soft, about 30 minutes (If using halved butternuts, bake until soft, then scoop out enough flesh to weigh 3 1/2 oz/100g. The 7 oz/200 g raw weight does shrink down to about 3 1/2 oz/100g when roasted, anyway).', 'Grease a bread tin of about 8 x 4 inches and about 3 inches deep with butter.', 'Drain the salmon and put in a large bowl. Remove crabsticks from coverings, and cut into the salmon, in thin rounds. Add the roasted butternut.', 'Add all the seasonings, from the ginger down to the sesame oil, and mix it all well with a fork, breaking up the butternut pieces.', 'Put the 3 tablespoons mayonnaise and 2 eggs in a bowl and whisk well. Add to the fish mixture.', 'Mix the whole caboodle well, until you have a slightly coarse mixture and all the ingredients have been well combined.', \\\"Scrape into the greased bread tin and smooth the top. If you like, sprinkle over breadcrumbs so the top doesn't dry out too much.\\\", 'Bake about 1 - 1 1/4 hour, until firm.', 'Turn out carefully on a platter. Serve garnished with pickled cucumber or gherkins, extra mayonnaise, fried tomatoes, mashed potatoes, a green vegetable, and a salad. Use a serrated knife for slicing, or the slices might crumble.']\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/35/53/45/picbDuWof.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/35/53/45/pic6PYU4e.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/35/53/45/picAe0QUY.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 2.0, \"Calories\": 379.9, \"FatContent\": 21.0, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 3.6, \"CholesterolContent\": 152.8, \"SodiumContent\": 1202.2, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 19.2, \"FiberContent\": 1.6, \"SugarContent\": 5.8, \"ProteinContent\": 28.8, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT1H30M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H45M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 90.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 105.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['salmon', 'salt', 'black pepper', 'fresh ginger', 'Thai fish sauce', 'garlic', 'spring onions', 'parsley', 'lime juice', 'lemon juice', 'Tabasco sauce', 'olive oil', 'mayonnaise', 'eggs']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['salmon', 'salt', 'black pepper', 'fresh ginger', 'Thai fish sauce', 'garlic', 'spring onions', 'parsley', 'lime juice', 'lemon juice', 'Tabasco sauce', 'olive oil', 'mayonnaise', 'eggs']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['salmon', 'salt', 'black pepper', 'ginger', 'thai fish sauce', 'garlic', 'green onion', 'parsley', 'lime juice', 'lemon juice', 'tabasco sauce', 'olive oil', 'mayonnaise', 'egg']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['salmon', 'salt', 'black pepper', 'ginger', 'thai fish sauce', 'garlic', 'green onion', 'parsley', 'lime juice', 'lemon juice', 'tabasco sauce', 'olive oil', 'mayonnaise', 'egg']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['salmon', 'salt', 'black pepper', 'ginger', 'thai fish sauce', 'garlic', 'green onion', 'parsley', 'lime juice', 'lemon juice', 'tabasco sauce'