 5 - 8 minutes. Remove from oven and cool on sheet for a few minutes, then place on wire rack to cool completely. Repeat with the rest of the dough after cookie sheet cools. This should give you a very close approximation to the Levain Bakery chocolate chip cookies.', \\\"If you'd like to make them somewhat smaller I suggest using a 375 degree oven temp so they don't over-brown, though they may not rise quite as high.\\\"]\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/29/43/00/piciged7l.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/29/43/00/pic2UXjOE.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/29/43/00/picHmBfpy.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/29/43/00/picC49IBz.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 4.5, \"ReviewCount\": 14.0, \"Calories\": 442.6, \"FatContent\": 25.4, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 13.3, \"CholesterolContent\": 61.4, \"SodiumContent\": 395.1, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 53.5, \"FiberContent\": 2.5, \"SugarContent\": 33.2, \"ProteinContent\": 5.3, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT20M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT15M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT35M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 35.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['butter', 'all-purpose flour', 'baking powder', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'light brown sugar', 'white sugar', 'eggs', 'walnuts', 'pecans']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['butter', 'all-purpose flour', 'baking powder', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'light brown sugar', 'white sugar', 'eggs', 'walnuts', 'pecans']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['butter', 'all purpose flour', 'baking powder', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'brown sugar', 'sugar', 'egg', 'walnut', 'pecan']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['butter', 'all purpose flour', 'baking powder', 'baking soda', 'salt'