nt\": 8.6, \"CholesterolContent\": 0.0, \"SodiumContent\": 2386.2, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 378.6, \"FiberContent\": 57.5, \"SugarContent\": 94.2, \"ProteinContent\": 74.1, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT30M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT30M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['warm water', 'active dry yeast', 'honey', 'salt', 'whole wheat flour']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['warm water', 'active dry yeast', 'honey', 'salt', 'whole wheat flour']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['warm water', 'active dry yeast', 'honey', 'salt', 'whole wheat flour']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['warm water', 'active dry yeast', 'honey', 'salt', 'whole wheat flour']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['warm water', 'active dry yeast', 'honey', 'salt', 'whole wheat flour']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['warm water', 'active dry yeast', 'honey', 'salt', 'whole wheat flour']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 577.8000000000001, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 77.39999999999999, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 1514.4, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 296.4, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 3.4654130288784417, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 25.86971121558093, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Score\": 2, \"WHO_Healthy\": true, \"Energy_kJ\": 9344.964, \"A_score\": 38, \"C_score\": 10, \"FSA_Score\": 28, \"FSA_Healthy\": false, \"popularity_score\": 0.0, \"ID\": \"335256_foodcom\", \"WHO_binary\": true, \"FSA_binary\": false, \"FSA_binned\": 0, \"popularity_log\": 0.0, \"cluster\": \"3\", \"pca1\": 8.020297676962617, \"pca2\": 1.9811606685383225, \"protein_kcal\": 296.4, \"fat_kcal\": 577.8000000000001, \"carb_kcal\": 1514.4, \"protein_pct\": 12.40894247676463, \"fat_pct\": 24.189902034664655, \"net_carb_pct\": 63.4011554885707, \"satiety_score_raw\": 96.29146218782518, \"satiety\": 57.40980468637017, \"nutrient_density_raw\": 41.30585828509349, \"nutrient_density\": 78.32644407553201}, {\"RecipeId\": 278774, \"Name\": \"Christmas Stollen\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['Dry ingredients.', 'In a large bowl;.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tSift flour and sugar together. Mix well.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tAdd yeast. Mix well.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tMake a well in the middle. Set aside.', 'Wet ingredients.', 'In another bowl;.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tWarm the milk and butter.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tAdd one egg. Whisk until all the milk is absorbed.', 'The dough.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tPour wet ingredients into the dry ingredients. Combine well.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tLightly flour a clean kneading surface.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tTurn the dough out and knead until the surface is slightly shiny. The dough ball should be stretchy when it\\u2019s ready.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tLightly oil one of the mixing bowls. Place dough ball in the bowl and cover. Put the bowl in a warm place.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tLet rise for 1 hour or until the dough has doubled in size.', 'The part that makes it Christmas.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tRinse all the cherries to get rid of the juice.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tQuarter \\u00bc cup of the cherries, half red, half green.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tChop the remaining cherries in to (approximately) \\u00bc inch x \\u00bc inch bits.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tPlace all the cherries into a fine mesh strainer and rinse with luke warm water.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tOnce well rinsed to remove as much of the juice you can, turn out on to a clean tea towel. Fold the tea towel on to the cherries and gently press to remove any remaining water and juice.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tPlace in a small bowl.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tGrate the lemon rind and put in the bowl containing the cherries.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tPut the sliced almonds in the same bowl and mix all ingredients.', 'The Almond Paste.', '\\u2022\\\\\\\\tIn a small bowl, cube the almond paste. Add the white of the second egg. Discard the yolk. Blend well and set aside.', 'Preheat the oven to 375\\u00b0F Have a rack in the center.', 'Pour the fruit mixture on to a floured surface. After the dough has risen, place on top of the fruit mixture and knead until everything is well combined, flouring lightly as needed to keep the elasticity of the dough intact.', 'Roll the dough until about one-half inches thick. You should have a circle of dough about 14 - 16 inches in diameter.', 'If you are able, roll the almond paste in to a rope the length being about an inch shorter than the diameter of your rolled out dough. If you can\\u2019t roll the almond paste, spread it directly on to the rolled out dough, right across the center. Fold the dough in half, over the almond paste. Pat the dough together, flattening the almond paste a bit. Place the loaf corner to corner on to a flat baking sheet. Use parchment paper if you have it, otherwise you can lightly grease the baking sheet.', 'Let the loaf rise for 10 to 15 minutes (less if you want the loaf a bit flatter).', 'Bake for 30 minutes and check the bread. It should be golden brown.', 'Remove from the oven and cool. Rub the surface with margarine. When its just barely warm, sift icing sugar on to the crescent. Stick two or three holly leaves with a few holly berries on the center at the top (the non-iced part).', 'For serving, slice \\u00be inches wide. Store the bread in a plastic bag, after it\\u2019s completely cooled.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 220.4, \"FatContent\": 9.6, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 3.6, \"CholesterolContent\": 34.5, \"SodiumContent\": 13.6, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 30.1, \"FiberContent\": 1.6, \"SugarContent\": 13.4, \"ProteinContent\": 4.4, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT40M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT30M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H10M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 70.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['white flour', 'caster sugar', 'dry yeast', 'milk', 'unsalted butter', 'eggs', 'green maraschino ch