an & the basil, & beat together.When the courgettes are cooked, stir them into the egg mixture, the season to taste. Heat the remaining oil in the frying pan, swirling to cover the sides evenly.Tip in the courgette egg mixture & cook for 2-3 minsover a low heat so that the bottom & sides set.', 'Scatter the remaining pamesan on top of the frittata, transfer the pan to the oven & cook uncovered,for another 10 mins until just set, puffed up & lighlty golden.Loosen the sides with a palette knife & turn out onto a large, warmed serving plate. Cut into wedges to serve.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 351.0, \"FatContent\": 27.2, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 7.9, \"CholesterolContent\": 335.9, \"SodiumContent\": 440.3, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 8.1, \"FiberContent\": 1.5, \"SugarContent\": 3.5, \"ProteinContent\": 19.1, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT10M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT20M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT30M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 10.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['olive oil', 'onion', 'courgettes', 'thyme leaves', 'garlic cloves', 'eggs', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaves']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['olive oil', 'onion', 'courgettes', 'thyme leaves', 'garlic cloves', 'eggs', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaves']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['olive oil', 'onion', 'courgette', 'thyme leaf', 'garlic', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaf']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['olive oil', 'onion', 'courgette', 'thyme leaf', 'garlic', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaf']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['olive oil', 'onion', 'courgette', 'thyme leaf', 'garlic', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaf']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['olive oil', 'onion', 'courgette', 'thyme leaf', 'garlic', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaf']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 244.8, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 71.10000000000001, \"EnergyF