ips and almonds. Gently fold in blueberries just until distributed evenly. Transfer batter to greased pan, spreading evenly.', 'Bake until top is golden and toothpick inserted into center comes out with moist crumbs attached, about 40 minutes if using fresh berries or 45 minutes if using frozen berries. Cool in pan.', 'Cut into 16 squares and enjoy!']\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/44/90/41/pico2K2jy.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/44/90/41/pic4yJB6G.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 242.1, \"FatContent\": 13.2, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 6.7, \"CholesterolContent\": 35.7, \"SodiumContent\": 82.2, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 27.8, \"FiberContent\": 0.9, \"SugarContent\": 20.8, \"ProteinContent\": 3.9, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT45M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 45.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['white chocolate chips', 'flour', 'salt', 'cinnamon', 'nutmeg', 'clove', 'allspice', 'granulated sugar', 'brown sugar', 'unsalted butter', 'eggs', 'vanilla extract', 'vanilla vodka', 'white chocolate chips', 'fresh blueberries', 'frozen blueberries']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['white chocolate chips', 'flour', 'salt', 'cinnamon', 'nutmeg', 'clove', 'allspice', 'granulated sugar', 'brown sugar', 'unsalted butter', 'eggs', 'vanilla extract', 'vanilla vodka', 'white chocolate chips', 'fresh blueberries', 'frozen blueberries']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['white chocolate chip', 'flour', 'salt', 'cinnamon', 'nutmeg', 'clove', 'allspice', 'sugar', 'brown sugar', 'unsalted butter', 'egg', 'vanilla extract', 'vanilla vodka', 'blueberry']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['chocolate chip', 'flour', 'salt', 'cinnamon', 'nutmeg', 'garlic clove', 'allspice', 'sugar', 