 cencio (so as to obtain two strips joined at the ends), twist the side strips without breaking them,', 'Fry them in hot oil or lard, and dust them with confectioners sugar when they\\u2019re cool. This recipe is sufficient to make a platterful. Should the dough have formed a crust while it sat, knead it again before you roll it out.', 'My Mom also drizzles honey before the confectioners sugar.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 339.4, \"FatContent\": 8.8, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 4.5, \"CholesterolContent\": 121.0, \"SodiumContent\": 166.6, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 52.3, \"FiberContent\": 1.5, \"SugarContent\": 10.3, \"ProteinContent\": 8.9, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT1H\", \"CookTime\": \"PT10M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H10M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 10.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 70.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['flour', 'unsalted butter', \\\"confectioners' sugar\\\", 'eggs', 'brandy', 'baking powder', 'vanilla extract', 'salt']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['flour', 'unsalted butter', \\\"confectioners' sugar\\\", 'eggs', 'brandy', 'baking powder', 'vanilla extract', 'salt']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['flour', 'unsalted butter', 'powdered sugar', 'egg', 'brandy', 'baking powder', 'vanilla extract', 'salt']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['flour', 'unsalted butter', 'powdered sugar', 'egg', 'brandy', 'baking powder', 'vanilla extract', 'salt']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['flour', 'unsalted butter', 'powdered sugar', 'egg', 'brandy', 'baking powder', 'vanilla extract', 'salt']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['flour', 'unsalted butter', 'powdered sugar', 'egg', 'brandy', 'baking powder', 'vanilla extract', 'salt']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 79.2, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 40.5, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 209.2, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 35.6, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 11.932822628167356, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 23.33529758397171