, for 4-5 minutes, untill golden brown on each side (you could use toaster if you have one that can handle the thicker bread).', 'Place 1 slice of bread each into four bowls.', 'bring 2 inches of water to a simmer in skillet (If you opted to use toaster first melt one tbsp of butter in pan).', 'Break one egg into a saucer.', 'hold saucer as close to the water as you can and slide it carefully into the skillet.', 'Gently lift the white over the yolk with a wodden spoon.', 'break and cook other three eggs in this fashion - trying to keep them apart.', 'cook 3-5 minutes depending on firmness desired.', 'remove with slotted spoon and place one egg on top of each slice of bread in bowl.', 'sprinkle eggs with cheese and remove soup from heat and pour around it.', 'serve at once.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 303.1, \"FatContent\": 19.9, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 10.0, \"CholesterolContent\": 224.1, \"SodiumContent\": 584.8, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 16.8, \"FiberContent\": 0.5, \"SugarContent\": 3.2, \"ProteinContent\": 13.7, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT10M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT3M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT13M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 10.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 3.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 13.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['butter', 'eggs', 'parmesan cheese']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['butter', 'eggs', 'parmesan cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['butter', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['butter', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['butter', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['butter', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 179.1, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 90.0, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 67.2, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 54.8, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 29.69317057076872, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 59.08940943582975, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": false, \