"pca2\": 0.06736707271414737, \"protein_kcal\": 12.8, \"fat_kcal\": 79.2, \"carb_kcal\": 65.2, \"protein_pct\": 8.142493638676845, \"fat_pct\": 50.381679389312986, \"net_carb_pct\": 41.47582697201018, \"satiety_score_raw\": 16.099201517200715, \"satiety\": 18.731059376617004, \"nutrient_density_raw\": 1.5679934827619744, \"nutrient_density\": 37.81571002404899}, {\"RecipeId\": 457115, \"Name\": \"Swiss Zug Cherry Torte (Zuger Kirschtorte)\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['Nut Layer:', 'Beat the egg whites until stiff and fold in half (1/4 cup) powdered sugar.', 'Combine the remaining sugar, nuts and cornstarch, then fold this into the stiff egg whites.', 'Bake two layers from the mixture, using a spring form. at 350F for 10-15 minutes. (I trace 2 circles on parchment using the 9 or 8\\u201d spring form Place the parchment on a baking sheet Then I divide the batter between the 2 circles and lightly smooth to the lines of the circle then bake at 350 for 10 to 15 minutes. This is like a large macaroon and should be dry when done.', 'Biscuit Layer:', 'In a large bowl beat the egg yolks with 3 Tbsp warm water until creamy then add \\u00bc cup of powered sugar.', 'In a medium bowl beat the egg whites with the remaining \\u00bc cup sugar until stiff.', 'Fold the egg whites into the yolks and add the flour, cornstarch, baking powder and lemon zest to make a batter.', 'Using the same sized spring form as for the nut layer, grease or line with parchment then add batter.', 'Bake for 20 minutes at 350\\u00b0F.', 'Butter Cream:', 'Beat the butter until creamy.', 'Add the sugar and egg yolk and lastly the Kirsch.', 'Divide into 3 portions.', 'To Finish:', 'Let all the layers cool.', 'Spread 1/3 of the butter cream on the nut layer.', 'Stack a biscuit layer on top.', 'Sprinkle the biscuit layer with Kirsch then spread on the next 1/3 butter cream .', 'Lay the second nut layer on top.', 'Spread the remaining butter cream on top and on sides.', 'Dust the top with the powdered sugar.', 'Sprinkle the sides with nuts.', 'Using a knife mark the top, powdered sugar in diamond.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 362.4, \"FatContent\": 18.5, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 7.5, \"CholesterolContent\": 82.5, \"SodiumContent\": 141.0, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 45.8, \"FiberContent\": 1.4, \"SugarContent\": 33.3, \"ProteinContent\": 5.3, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT40M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT40M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H20M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 80.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['powdered sugar', 'hazelnuts', 'cornstarch', 'powdered sugar', 'flour', 'cornstarch', 'baking powder', 'lemon', 'butter', 'powdered sugar', 'kirsch', 'kirsch', 'hazelnuts', 'powdered sugar']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['powdered sugar', 'hazelnuts', 'cornstarch', 'powdered sugar', 'flour', 'cornstarch', 'baking powder', 'lemon', 'butter', 'powdered sugar', 'kirsch', 'kirsch', 'hazelnuts', 'powdered sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['powdered sugar', 'hazelnut', 'cornstarch', 'flour', 'baking powder', 'lemon', 'butter', 'kirsch']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['powdered sugar', 'hazelnut', 'cornstarch', 'flour', 'baking powder', 'lemon', 'butter', 'kirsch']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['powdered sugar', 'hazelnut', 'cornstarch', 'flour', 'baking powder', 'lemon', 'butter', 'kirsch']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['powdered sugar', 'hazelnut', 'cornstarch', 'flour', 'baking powder', 'lemon', 'butter', 'kirsch']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 166.5, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 67.5, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 183.2, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 21.2, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 18.625827814569536, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 45.943708609271525, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Score\": 1, \"WHO_Healthy\": false, \"Energy_kJ\": 1516.2816, \"A_score\": 19, \"C_score\": 4, \"FSA_Score\": 15, \"FSA_Healthy\": false, \"popularity_score\": 0.0, \"ID\": \"457115_foodcom\", \"WHO_binary\": false, \"FSA_binary\": false, \"FSA_binned\": 0, \"popularity_log\": 0.0, \"cluster\": \"0\", \"pca1\": -0.12418783813023386, \"pca2\": 1.1153934101742113, \"protein_kcal\": 21.2, \"fat_kcal\": 166.5, \"carb_kcal\": 183.2, \"protein_pct\": 5.715826368293341, \"fat_pct\": 44.890806147209496, \"net_carb_pct\": 49.39336748449717, \"satiety_score_raw\": 2.785552296999559, \"satiety\": 12.309551328020616, \"nutrient_density_raw\": -3.839744010916727, \"nutrient_density\": 32.3027964209558}, {\"RecipeId\": 485688, \"Name\": \"Berry Pancakes With Ricotta &amp; Maple Syrup\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['1. Working over a bowl, use a grater to zest the lemon, being careful not to remove any of the bitter white pith.  Cut the zested lemon into wedges, and set them aside.', '2.  Add the raspberries to the bowl containing the lemon zest.  Stir in 1/3 c sugar, gently crushing the raspberries with a wooden spoon.  Set aside while making the pancake batter.', '3.  In a medium bowl, combine the flour, salt, 1 Tbsp sugar and baking powder.  In another bowl, beat the ricotta cheese with milk and egg yolks.  Add the flour mixture to the ricotta mixture, and stir until just combined.  Let the batter sit for 10 minutes.', '4.  Beat the egg whites with a mixer until they hold soft peaks.  Next gently fold the raspberries with their juices into the batter, then fold in the egg whites.  (You want little clumps of whites in the batter.  The important thing is not to overmix it.).', '5.  Heat a large nonstick skillet over moderately low heat.  Melt 1/2 T butter at the center of the skillet, where you will spoon the batter.', '6.  Spoon the batter into the hot skillet, directly on the melted butter.', '7.  Cook each pancake until the bottom is golden brown and the bubbles on the surface begin to break, about 2 minutes.  Using a spatula, flip the pancake quickly.  Cook until golden brown, about 1 minute longer.', '8.  Serve finished pancake with maple syrup and lemon wedges.', '9.  Peaches and bananas work well in this recipe.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 578.0, \"FatContent\": 16.7, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 8.5, \"CholesterolContent\": 228.0, \"SodiumContent\": 580.2, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 84.8, \"FiberContent\": 7.2, \"SugarContent\": 24.1, \"ProteinContent\": 23.3, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT30M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT15M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT45M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 45.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['lemon', 'raspberries', 'sugar', 'sugar', 'all-purpose flour', 'salt', 'baking powder', 'ricotta cheese', 'milk', 'eggs', 'maple syrup']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['lemon', 'raspberries', 'sugar', 'sugar', 'all-purpose flour', 'salt', 'baking powder', 'ricotta cheese', 'milk', 'eggs', 'maple syrup']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['lemon', 'raspberry', 'sugar', 'all purpose flour', 'salt', 'baking powder', 'ricotta cheese', 'milk', 'egg', 'maple syrup']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['lemon', 'raspberry', 'sugar', 'all purpose flour', 'salt', 'baking powder', 'ricotta cheese', 'milk', 'egg', 'maple syrup']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['lemon', 'raspberry', 'sugar', 'all purpose flour', 'salt', 'baking powder', 'ricotta cheese', 'milk', 'egg', 'maple syrup']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['lemon', 'raspberry', 'sugar', 'all purpose flour', 'salt', 'baking powder', 'ricotta cheese', 'milk', 'egg', 'maple syrup']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 150.29999999999998, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 76.5, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 339.2, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 93.2, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 13.23529411764706, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 26.003460207612456, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Score\": 2, \"WHO_Health