p to one month.', 'When ready to serve, thaw wrapped potatoes in refrigerator overnight or unwrap and thaw at room temperature.', 'Preheat oven to 350\\u00b0F  Spray with cooking spray a baking dish or pan large enough to hold potatoes in a single layer.  Combine raw sugar, cinnamon and mace in a large shallow dish.  Roll each potato in the sugar mixture to coat evenly.  Arrange potatoes in baking dish.', 'Pour 1 cup orange juice into bottom of baking dish with potatoes.  Scatter butter bits evenly over top of potatoes.  Bake 30 minutes.  Remove from oven and baste potatoes with pan juices.  Serve warm.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 277.9, \"FatContent\": 5.9, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 3.7, \"CholesterolContent\": 15.2, \"SodiumContent\": 112.9, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 55.4, \"FiberContent\": 4.1, \"SugarContent\": 33.7, \"ProteinContent\": 2.4, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT30M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT30M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['sweet potatoes', 'sweet potatoes', 'raw sugar', 'ground cinnamon', 'ground mace', 'butter']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['sweet potatoes', 'sweet potatoes', 'raw sugar', 'ground cinnamon', 'ground mace', 'butter']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['sweet potato', 'sugar', 'cinnamon', 'mace', 'butter']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['sweet potato', 'sugar', 'cinnamon', 'mace', 'butter']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['sweet potato', 'sugar', 'cinnamon', 'mace', 'butter']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['sweet potato', 'sugar', 'cinnamon', 'mace', 'butter']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 53.1, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 33.300000000000004, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 221.6, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 9.6, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 11.982727599856066, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 19.10759265922994, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": false, \"WH