 towel.', 'Dump the other half of the wontons into the pot. When the water starts boiling again, remove the wontons and place on the other plate. Cover with another damp tea towel.', 'Using the thin green end of the chive, take a wonton and tie a knot around the neck of the wonton. Carefully tighten. Use scissors and trim so that the ends are even. Place on serving plate.', 'Repeat with remaining wontons.', 'Serve warm with dipping sauces.', 'For sauce 1: Mix in a bowl and serve.', 'For sauce 2: Place the jam in a bowl and heat on low in the microwave for 30-45 seconds, or until soft.', 'Add the sweet chilli sauce and fish sauce, combine and serve.']\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/14/23/57/picRTSuei.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/14/23/57/picVyzJuC.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 3.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 400.1, \"FatContent\": 10.8, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 3.8, \"CholesterolContent\": 67.0, \"SodiumContent\": 1664.1, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 57.3, \"FiberContent\": 2.9, \"SugarContent\": 5.5, \"ProteinContent\": 17.6, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT40M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT10M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT50M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 10.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 50.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['cornflour', 'water chestnuts', 'shallots', 'garlic cloves', 'soy sauce', 'sugar', 'black pepper', 'chives', 'wonton wrappers', 'salt', 'water', 'egg', 'soy sauce', 'white vinegar', 'sugar', 'cranberry sauce', 'fish sauce']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['cornflour', 'water chestnuts', 'shallots', 'garlic cloves', 'soy sauce', 'sugar', 'black pepper', 'chives', 'wonton wrappers', 'salt', 'water', 'egg', 'soy sauce', 'white vinegar', 'sugar', 'cranberry sauce', 'fish sauce']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['cornflour', 'water chestnut', 'shallot', 'garlic', 'soy sauc