oes, stir to mix vegetables and saute 1 more minute to cook off any liquid.', 'With a slotted spoon, transfer the vegetables to the dish, spreading them evenly over the bread. Place the spinch leaves evenly on the top. Give the milk and egg mixture a stir and gently pour it all into the dish. Top with the remaining cheese. Bake until the milk and egg mixture sets, 40 to 45 minutes. Let cool at least 5 minutes, slice into squares with the edge of a spatula, and use the spatula to lift out the pieces.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 821.9, \"FatContent\": 39.6, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 18.7, \"CholesterolContent\": 318.4, \"SodiumContent\": 994.2, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 85.5, \"FiberContent\": 5.3, \"SugarContent\": 8.2, \"ProteinContent\": 33.1, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT0S\", \"CookTime\": \"PT45M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT45M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 0.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 45.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 45.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['garlic clove', 'milk', 'eggs', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaves', 'olive oil', 'onion', 'zucchini', 'tomatoes']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['garlic clove', 'milk', 'eggs', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaves', 'olive oil', 'onion', 'zucchini', 'tomatoes']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['garlic', 'milk', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaf', 'olive oil', 'onion', 'zucchini', 'tomato']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['garlic', 'milk', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaf', 'olive oil', 'onion', 'zucchini', 'tomato']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['garlic', 'milk', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaf', 'olive oil', 'onion', 'zucchini', 'tomato']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['garlic', 'milk', 'egg', 'parmesan cheese', 'basil leaf', 'olive oil', 'onion', 'zucchini', 'tomato']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 356.40000000000003, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 168.29999999999998, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 342.0, \"EnergyFromProtein