age is 90% cooked through.', 'Add peppers to pan and complete the browning of the sausage.  Add the grape tomatoes and feta.  Stir to combine.  Sprinkle with chives and basil or other spices you like. Stir to combine and remove from heat and let the feta melt while set aside.', 'Whisk together the five eggs and milk until frothy.', 'Place the pie crust in a 9-inch pie plate if not already in one.  Set the pie plate on a cookie sheet or jelly roll pan.  In the unbaked pie crust sprinkle 1/2 the cheddar cheese on the bottom.  Dump the skillet contents into the shell and then sprinkle the remaining cheddar.', 'Pour the egg/milk mixture over the top slowly, allowing the mixture to absorb through.  Add pepper to taste.', 'Let the quiche sit while you preheat the oven to 350\\u00b0 placing the rack in the center.  When oven is warmed, place the cookie sheet with quiche in and bake for 45 minutes to 1 hour or until knife comes out clean.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 663.3, \"FatContent\": 46.0, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 19.8, \"CholesterolContent\": 353.1, \"SodiumContent\": 1187.9, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 31.5, \"FiberContent\": 3.1, \"SugarContent\": 3.8, \"ProteinContent\": 30.7, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT20M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT1H\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H20M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 80.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['eggs', 'milk', 'onion', 'garlic cloves', 'sweet pepper', 'grape tomatoes', 'fresh chives', 'dried basil', 'feta cheese', 'fresh ground pepper', 'sharp cheddar cheese']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['eggs', 'milk', 'onion', 'garlic cloves', 'sweet pepper', 'grape tomatoes', 'fresh chives', 'dried basil', 'feta cheese', 'fresh ground pepper', 'sharp cheddar cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['egg', 'milk', 'onion', 'garlic', 'sweet pepper', 'grape tomato', 'chive', 'basil', 'feta cheese', 'pepper', 'sharp ch