ire rack (with a piece of waxed paper placed under the rack to catch any syrup drippings) to cool.', 'For the Syrup:', 'Combine sugar and water over medium heat until sugar is dissolved.', 'Stop stirring and bring syrup to boil. Remove pan from heat and stir in rum. Randomly pierce cake with fork.', 'Pour half of syrup over cake.', 'Let stand for 5 minutes.', 'Using pastry brush, gently brush remaining syrup over top and sides of cake.', 'For the Glaze:', 'Bring cream and corn syrup to a gentle boil then remove from heat.', 'Pour mixture over chocolate chips, let stand until melted them whisk smooth.', 'Whisk in rum and vanilla.', 'Pour over cake.', 'Chill the cake for 5-10 minutes to set glaze.', 'Refrigerate glazed cake in an airtight container.', 'Remove cake from refrigerator one hour before serving.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 548.0, \"FatContent\": 30.1, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 14.2, \"CholesterolContent\": 83.6, \"SodiumContent\": 414.1, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 60.3, \"FiberContent\": 3.0, \"SugarContent\": 38.8, \"ProteinContent\": 6.3, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT30M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT1H\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H30M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 90.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['milk', 'water', 'eggs', 'sour cream', 'butter', 'water', 'granulated sugar', 'dark rum', 'heavy whipping cream', 'dark rum', 'light corn syrup', 'vanilla extract']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['milk', 'water', 'eggs', 'sour cream', 'butter', 'water', 'granulated sugar', 'dark rum', 'heavy whipping cream', 'dark rum', 'light corn syrup', 'vanilla extract']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['milk', 'water', 'egg', 'sour cream', 'butter', 'sugar', 'dark rum', 'heavy whipping cream', 'light corn syrup', 'vanilla extract']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['milk', 'water', 'egg', 'sour cream', 'butter', 'sugar', 'rum', 'heavy whipping cream',