00eape over carefully with your fingertips. Cook until underside is set, about20 seconds more. Transfer cr\\u00eape to a plate. Make another cr\\u00eape in same manner, brushing skillet again with oil.', \\\"Prepare filling and assemble hors d'oeuvre:\\\", 'Stir together cream cheese, lemon juice, zest, and pepper in a small bowl until smooth.', 'Put 1 cr\\u00eape, browned side up, on a work surface, and spread with all of cheese mixture. Arrange salmon in an even layer over bottom half of cr\\u00eape (side nearest you), then scatter radishes over salmon. Beginning at bottom, tightly roll up cr\\u00eape, then cut roll crosswise into 4 pieces, trimming ends if desired.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 211.6, \"FatContent\": 14.0, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 5.4, \"CholesterolContent\": 128.9, \"SodiumContent\": 213.4, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 11.7, \"FiberContent\": 0.5, \"SugarContent\": 2.6, \"ProteinContent\": 9.6, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT15M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT30M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['all-purpose flour', 'egg', 'fresh chives', 'fresh dill', 'cream cheese', 'fresh lemon juice', 'fresh lemon zest', 'fresh coarse ground black pepper', 'smoked salmon', 'radishes']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['all-purpose flour', 'egg', 'fresh chives', 'fresh dill', 'cream cheese', 'fresh lemon juice', 'fresh lemon zest', 'fresh coarse ground black pepper', 'smoked salmon', 'radishes']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['all purpose flour', 'egg', 'chive', 'dill', 'cream cheese', 'lemon juice', 'lemon zest', 'coarse black pepper', 'salmon', 'radishe']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['all purpose flour', 'egg', 'chive', 'dill', 'cream cheese', 'lemon juice', 'lemon zest', 'coarse black pepper', 'salmon', 'radishe']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['all purpose flour', 'e