 \"['Preheat oven to 350. Grease and flour a 10 inch tube pan.', 'in a glass measuring cup, microwave the white chocolate on high for 1 minute, then stir until smooth. Let cool slightly.', 'Place remaining ingredients in a large mixing bowl, then add chocolate.', 'Mix at low speed for 1 minute, scraping sides down frequently.', 'Increase mixer speed to medium and beat 2 minutes more, scraping sides down as needed.', 'Pour batter into prepared pan.', 'Bake for 38-42 minutes, or until tests done.', 'Remove from oven and allow to cool for 20 minutes, then run a long sharp knife around edge of cake. Invert the cake onto a wire rack,  then invert again so it is right side up.', 'Let cool for about 20 minutes more.', 'While cake is still warm, make a thin glaze with orange juice and powdered sugar. Drizzle over cake and let rest for 10 minutes before slicing.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 301.9, \"FatContent\": 13.8, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 4.3, \"CholesterolContent\": 46.4, \"SodiumContent\": 251.8, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 40.3, \"FiberContent\": 0.3, \"SugarContent\": 32.0, \"ProteinContent\": 4.9, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT40M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT55M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 55.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['orange zest', 'white chocolate', 'ricotta cheese', 'eggs', 'powdered sugar', 'orange zest']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['orange zest', 'white chocolate', 'ricotta cheese', 'eggs', 'powdered sugar', 'orange zest']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['orange zest', 'chocolate', 'ricotta cheese', 'egg', 'powdered sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['lemon zest', 'bittersweet chocolate', 'ricotta cheese', 'egg', 'powdered sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['lemon zest', 'bittersweet chocolate', 'ricotta cheese', 'egg', 'powdered sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_rep