 thick.  Overlap slices neatly in dough-lined pan.  Pour nut mixture over fruit.', 'Bake in a 325\\u00b0 oven until crust is browned and apples are tender when pierced, 50 to 60 minutes.', 'In a 6 to 8-inch frying pan over medium heat, stir jam until melted; add liqueur.  Spoon warm jam evenly over hot tart.  Return to oven and bake until jam bubbles slightly, 3 to 5 minutes.', 'Let tart cool on a rack at least 30 minutes; remove pan rim.  Serve warm or cooled off.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 436.0, \"FatContent\": 23.4, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 12.0, \"CholesterolContent\": 151.3, \"SodiumContent\": 153.7, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 52.6, \"FiberContent\": 2.2, \"SugarContent\": 33.4, \"ProteinContent\": 6.5, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT1H\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H15M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 75.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'sugar', 'butter', 'eggs', 'granny smith apples']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'sugar', 'butter', 'eggs', 'granny smith apples']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'butter', 'egg', 'granny smith apple']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'butter', 'egg', 'granny smith apple']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'butter', 'egg', 'granny smith apple']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'butter', 'egg', 'granny smith apple']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 210.6, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 108.0, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 210.4, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 26.0, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 24.770642201834864, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 48.30275229357798, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Score\": 1, \"WHO_Healthy\": false, \"Energy_kJ\": 1824.224, \"A_score\": 23, \"C_score\": 6, \"FSA_Score\": 17, \"FSA_Health