oil into a frying pan. When it\\u2019s hot dip the chicken in the egg then the bread crumbs. Fry on both sides until brown. (You do not need to cook them all the way.) Add the chicken to the baking pan.', 'Brown all the pieces of chicken. Pour the rest of the sauce over each piece of chicken.', 'Cover with foil and bake for 20 minutes.', 'After 20 minutes, remove the foil and add the mozzarella cheese. Bake uncovered for about 15 more minutes or until the cheese is melted.', 'Serve and enjoy!']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 851.9, \"FatContent\": 28.6, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 11.6, \"CholesterolContent\": 242.6, \"SodiumContent\": 2485.3, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 69.6, \"FiberContent\": 8.0, \"SugarContent\": 21.1, \"ProteinContent\": 74.6, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT20M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT40M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['boneless skinless chicken breasts', 'egg', 'milk', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['boneless skinless chicken breasts', 'egg', 'milk', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['chicken breast', 'egg', 'milk', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['chicken breast', 'egg', 'milk', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['chicken breast', 'egg', 'milk', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['chicken breast', 'egg', 'milk', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 257.40000000000003, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 104.4, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 278.4, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 298.4, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 12.254959502289, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 30.214813945298747, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Score\": 0, \"WHO_Healthy\": false, \"Energy_kJ\": 3564.3496, \"A_score\": 34, \"C_score\": 10, \"FSA_Score\": 24, \"FSA_Healthy\": false, \"popularity_score\": 0.0, \"ID\": \"518795_foodcom\", \"WHO_binary\": false, \"FSA_binary\": false, \"FSA_binned\": 0, \"popularity_log\": 0.0, \"cluster\": \"3\", \"pca1\": 3.224853299503577, \"pca2\": -1.4518565371604346, \"protein_kcal\": 298.4, \"fat_kcal\": 257.40000000000003, \"carb_kcal\": 278.4, \"protein_pct\": 35.77079836969552, \"fat_pct\": 30.855909853752106, \"net_carb_pct\": 33.373291776552385, \"satiety_score_raw\": 33.73816044885712, \"satiety\": 27.238773142774154, \"nutrient_density_raw\": 38.22467869154694, \"nutrient_density\": 75.18533803725043}, {\"RecipeId\": 457548, \"Name\": \"Less Sugar Canned Strawberry Jam\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['Wash jars & screw bands in hot soapy water. Rinse well in warm water. Pour boiling water over flat lids in a pan off the heat. Let stand in hot water until ready to use. Drain well before using.', 'Fill canner half full of water and bring to a simmer.', 'Prepare berries by crushing 1 cup at a time using a potato masher.', 'Measure exact amount of fruit into an 8qt. saucepan.', 'Measure the exact amount of sugar into a separate bowl. (Do not reduce sugar or use sugar substitute. Look up no-sugar-needed recipes for those amounts.).', 'Mix 1/4 cup of sugar from measured amount with Sure-Jell. (Make sure to use the pink box of less or no sugar needed pectin!).', 'Stir sugar & pectin mixture into berries. Add 1/2 teaspoons butter to reduce foaming, if desired.', 'Bring to a full rolling boil (a boil that does not stop bubbling when stirred) stirring constantly.', 'Stir in sugar, quickly. Return mixture to a full rolling boil and boil exactly 1 minute, stirring constantly.', 'Remove from heat. Skim foam from top with metal spoon.', 'Ladle quickly into jars to within 1/8 inch of top.', \\\"Wipe jars' rims and threads and top with two-piece lids.\\\", 'Place jars in water bath canner for 10 minutes, then remove from canner. Let cool completely before storing. Press on middle of the lid to make sure lids have sealed. If not, store in refrigerator.']\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/45/75/48/picWxmxY0.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/45/75/48/pica74e8o.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 3.0, \"Calories\": 492.9, \"FatContent\": 0.8, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.0, \"CholesterolContent\": 0.0, \"SodiumContent\": 16.1, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 126.2, \"FiberContent\": 5.9, \"SugarContent\": 112.9, \"ProteinContent\": 1.8, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT20M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT25M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT45M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 25.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 45.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['strawberries', 'sugar', 'butter']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['strawberries', 'sugar', 'butter']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['strawberry', 'sugar', 'butter']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['strawberry', 'sugar', 'butter']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['strawberry', 'sugar', 'butter']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['strawberry', 'sugar', 'butter']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 7.2, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 0.0, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 504.8, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 7.2, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 0.0, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 1.4607425441265978, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Score\": 3, \"WHO_Healthy\": true, \"Energy_kJ\": 2062.2936, \"A_score\": 16, \"C_score\": 6, \"FSA_Score\": 10, \"FSA_Healthy\": false, \"popularity_score\": 15.0, \"ID\": \"457548_foodcom\", \"WHO_binary\": true, \"FSA_binary\": false, \"FSA_binned\": 1, \"popularity_log\": 2.772588722239781, \"cluster\": \"2\", \"pca1\": 0.38576135812424667, \"pca2\": 4.643426561325033, \"protein_kcal\": 7.2, \"fat_kcal\": 7.2, \"carb_kcal\": 504.8, \"protein_pct\": 1.3867488443759628, \"fat_pct\": 1.3867488443759628, \"net_carb_pct\": 97.22650231124807, \"satiety_score_raw\": 6.645020179542927, \"satiety\": 14.171069808877586, \"nutrient_density_raw\": -12.680163137914835, \"nutrient_density\": 23.29043831014831}, {\"RecipeId\": 109316, \"Name\": \"Salmon and Rice Wrapped in Pastry With Dill Sauce\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['For Salmon, Rice and Pastry: Bring medium saucepan of salted water to a boil.', 'Add the rice; boil uncovered until just tender-- about 18 minutes.', 'Drain.', 'Melt butter in a heavy medium skillet over medium-low heat.', 'Add leek and saut\\u00e8 until beginning to soften-- about 4 minutes.', 'Add the mushrooms and cover the skillet and cook until mushrooms release their juices, stirring occasionally-- about 5 minutes.', 'Uncover skillet, increase heat to medium-high and saut\\u00e8 until liquid evaporates-- about 3 minutes.', 'Transfer to bowl and add rice.', 'Season with salt and pepper.', 'Cool completely.', 'Butter a large baking sheet.', 'Roll out 1 puff pastry sheet on a floured surface to 12\\\\\\\\', ', ', ', ', ', ', ', ', ', ', ', ', ' square size.', 'Cut into 4 equal squares.', 'Lay 1 square atop each salmon fillet, tucking corners under bottom pastry to enclose salmon completely.', 'Pinch edges together to seal (brush with egg mixture if necessary to help it adhere).', 'Arrange salmon packages, seam side down, on prepared baking sheet.', 'Cover and chill 30 minutes.', '(Can be made up to 8 hours ahead-- Keep chilled).', 'Preheat oven to 400\\u00b0.', 'Brush top of pastry with egg mixture.', 'Bake until golden and thermometer inserted into fish registers 145\\u00b0-- about 30 minutes.', 'For Dill Sauce: Combine clam juice and wine in heavy small non-aluminum saucepan.', 'Boil until reduced to 1/3 cup-- about 9 minutes.', 'Reduce heat to medium.', 'Whisk in Cr\\u00e8me Fra\\u00eeche.', 'Boil until reduced to 1 cup-- about 5 minutes.', 'Remove from heat, stir in dill and season with salt and