 pot.', 'In the morning, bring the oats and water to a boil, stir, lower heat and cover. Let it bubble gently, stirring occasionally, for about 5-7 minutes. Around when it starts to stick, remove from heat and leave covered for 3 minutes. (This ensures that none is stuck to the pot, and also helps creaminess.).', \\\"Meanwhile, as it's cooking assemble the other ingredients.\\\", 'Pour oatmeal into your serving bowl. Stir in other ingredients, top with additional ground flax if desired, and enjoy immediately!', 'Double or triple accordingly, it comes out perfect.']\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/21/80/26/picdvOWdg.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/21/80/26/picDPFp9j.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/21/80/26/pichcqpdi.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 4.5, \"ReviewCount\": 7.0, \"Calories\": 373.3, \"FatContent\": 18.0, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 1.9, \"CholesterolContent\": 0.0, \"SodiumContent\": 14.2, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 46.8, \"FiberContent\": 9.7, \"SugarContent\": 12.3, \"ProteinContent\": 10.2, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT5M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT10M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT15M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 5.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 10.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['rolled oats', 'water', 'apple', 'ground flax seeds', 'walnut pieces', 'ground cinnamon', 'vanilla-flavored soymilk', 'non-dairy milk substitute', 'maple syrup']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['rolled oats', 'water', 'apple', 'ground flax seeds', 'walnut pieces', 'ground cinnamon', 'vanilla-flavored soymilk', 'non-dairy milk substitute', 'maple syrup']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['rolled oat', 'water', 'apple', 'flax seed', 'walnut piece', 'cinnamon', 'soymilk', 'non dairy milk substitute', 'maple syrup']\", \"ingredients_canonical_a