pper.  Add the chops to the pan and cook until well seared on the underside, about 4 minutes.  Turn and continue to cook until pale pink when cut into at the thickest point, about 3 minutes more.', 'Transfer the pork chops to a warmed platter and top with the relish, dividing evenly.  Garnish with rosemary sprigs and serve hot.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 255.0, \"FatContent\": 8.6, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 2.9, \"CholesterolContent\": 80.8, \"SodiumContent\": 261.4, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 12.2, \"FiberContent\": 1.0, \"SugarContent\": 6.0, \"ProteinContent\": 31.7, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT10M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT35M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT45M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 10.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 35.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 45.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['shallots', 'salt', 'fresh ground pepper', 'plum tomatoes', 'fresh flat-leaf parsley', 'honey', 'fresh rosemary', 'rosemary sprig', 'cayenne pepper', 'boneless pork loin chops']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['shallots', 'salt', 'fresh ground pepper', 'plum tomatoes', 'fresh flat-leaf parsley', 'honey', 'fresh rosemary', 'rosemary sprig', 'cayenne pepper', 'boneless pork loin chops']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['shallot', 'salt', 'pepper', 'plum tomato', 'parsley', 'honey', 'rosemary', 'rosemary sprig', 'cayenne pepper', 'pork chop']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['shallot', 'salt', 'pepper', 'plum tomato', 'parsley', 'honey', 'rosemary', 'mint sprig', 'cayenne pepper', 'pork chop']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['shallot', 'salt', 'pepper', 'plum tomato', 'parsley', 'honey', 'rosemary', 'mint sprig', 'cayenne pepper', 'pork chop']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['shallot', 'salt', 'pepper', 'plum tomato', 'parsley', 'honey', 'rosemary', 'mint sprig', 'cayenne pepper', 'pork chop']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 77.39999999999999, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 26.1, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 48.8, \