turn the heat down and when you flip it to help maintain the beautiful char and moistness.  When steak is done to your taste, remove from grill and let sit for 3-4 minutes covered with aluminum foil.', 'A steak of this quality should be enjoyed with a great Cabernet Sauvignon.', 'Sides:', 'Garlic-butter Mushrooms.', 'Garlic-butter marinade: (Mix up in a small ramekin).', '1 ounce of EV olive oil.', '1 tsp butter.', '1 clove garlic finely chopped.', '1/8 tsp fresh cracked pepper.', '1/8 tsp salt.', 'Remove the stems from 4-6 mushrooms and dredge the mushroom caps well in the garlic butter mixture.  Place them head down on a 12\\\\\\\\', ' square of aluminum foil and wrap up and seal into a packet for the grill.  Put this packet on the grill when your turn the heat down to 350\\u00b0 after searing your steak and they should be done perfectly in about 12-15 minutes.', 'Seasoned Yukon Gold.', 'After a good scrubbing, stab the Yukon Gold with a fork several times. Rub the skin with a small amount of EV olive oil to moisten it, then season the skin with salt, pepper and some chive flakes and wrap the potato in aluminum foil.  The potato will take about an hour on the grill @ 350\\u00b0 so make your cooking plans accordingly.', 'Bon Appetite!']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 1317.8, \"FatContent\": 78.5, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 31.6, \"CholesterolContent\": 231.3, \"SodiumContent\": 243.3, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 94.5, \"FiberContent\": 29.3, \"SugarContent\": 2.8, \"ProteinContent\": 74.5, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT20M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT35M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 35.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['peppercorn', 'cremini mushrooms', 'yukon gold potato']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['peppercorn', 'cremini mushrooms', 'yukon gold potato']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['peppercorn', 'mushroom', 'yukon 