 steaks well done.Steaks should literally fall apart when taken out of crock-pot.The toughest steaks are soooooo tender!', 'Yield depends on how many steaks are cooked and how many people show up at your door!', 'If I have any leftovers a day or so later,I cut them up small and pan fry them for a \\\\\\\\', ' like meal.Can fry a couple of eggs alongside  this for a breakfast or brunch.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 303.5, \"FatContent\": 2.8, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.7, \"CholesterolContent\": 2.8, \"SodiumContent\": 1194.2, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 60.4, \"FiberContent\": 5.3, \"SugarContent\": 4.6, \"ProteinContent\": 10.7, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT30M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT10H\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT10H30M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 600.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 630.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['yukon gold potatoes', 'fresh mushrooms', 'onion', 'flour', 'beef broth', 'fresh ground black pepper']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['yukon gold potatoes', 'fresh mushrooms', 'onion', 'flour', 'beef broth', 'fresh ground black pepper']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['yukon gold potato', 'mushroom', 'onion', 'flour', 'beef broth', 'black pepper']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['yukon gold potato', 'mushroom', 'onion', 'flour', 'beef broth', 'black pepper']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['yukon gold potato', 'mushroom', 'onion', 'flour', 'beef broth', 'black pepper']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['yukon gold potato', 'mushroom', 'onion', 'flour', 'beef broth', 'black pepper']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 25.2, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 6.3, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 241.6, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 42.8, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 2.0757825370675453, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 8.303130148270181, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Score\": 2, \"WHO_Healthy\": true, \"Energy