9872, \"Name\": \"Classic Tuna Salad\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['Place the tuna in a colander and drain well.', 'Shred the tuna with your fingers, breaking up any clumps until it has a fine and even texture.', 'Put the tuna in a medium bowl and mix in the lemon juice, celery, onion, pickles, garlic, salt, pepper, and parsley until well blended.', 'Fold in the mayonnaise and Dijon until mixture is evenly moistened.', 'Salad can be kept covered in the refrigerator for up to 3 days.']\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/10/98/72/ZDJzIFyiS3qhAwaYjyh6_tuna SITE-3.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/10/98/72/jeS1jUTTIalDqLeGbkjC_IMG_2459%20tuna%20salad.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/10/98/72/wgEyap7QQWTp0Dm4zvTo_IMG_2452%20tuna%20salad.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/10/98/72/pichLyNiY.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/10/98/72/13idzeqTryokPgpNuIeh_IMG_2468%20tuna%20salad.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/10/98/72/b1wkhTmcTKykLRIIZCxU_tuna SITE-2.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/10/98/72/DkC8RDJPQS2BhBjvxUql_tuna SITE.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 4.5, \"ReviewCount\": 10.0, \"Calories\": 116.4, \"FatContent\": 2.6, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.7, \"CholesterolContent\": 35.7, \"SodiumContent\": 664.8, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 1.8, \"FiberContent\": 0.4, \"SugarContent\": 0.7, \"ProteinContent\": 20.4, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": null, \"TotalTime\": \"PT15M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": null, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"RecipeIngre