for 2-3 minutes,  after that add remaining cream mix it, switch off tge flame, add coriander, and cover it for 10 minutes, open it and serve it.', 'TIPS.', '- YOU CAN DO STEP ONE AND TWO SIMONTANIOUSLY FOR SAVING TIME.', \\\"- EITHER YOU CAN KEEP SOUCE READY FOR FUTURE USE. BUT DON'T USE CURDED AND CREAM IN THAT CASE WHILE MAKING THE SOUCE.\\\", '#TRY IT AND SHARE THE EXPERIENCE .']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 353.3, \"FatContent\": 1.5, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.3, \"CholesterolContent\": 0.0, \"SodiumContent\": 12.0, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 72.3, \"FiberContent\": 4.9, \"SugarContent\": 7.5, \"ProteinContent\": 12.4, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT15M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT30M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['pasta', 'onions', 'ginger', 'tomatoes', 'tea', 'coriander powder']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['pasta', 'onions', 'ginger', 'tomatoes', 'tea', 'coriander powder']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['pasta', 'onion', 'ginger', 'tomato', 'tea', 'coriander powder']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['pasta', 'onion', 'ginger', 'tomato', 'tea', 'coriander powder']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['pasta', 'onion', 'ginger', 'tomato', 'tea', 'coriander powder']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['pasta', 'onion', 'ginger', 'tomato', 'tea', 'coriander powder']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 13.5, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 2.6999999999999997, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 289.2, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 49.6, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 0.7642230399094253, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 3.821115199547126, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Score\": 3, \"WHO_Healthy\": true, \"Energy_kJ\": 1478.2072, \"A_score\": 5, \"C_score\": 10, \"FSA_Score\": -5, \"FSA_Healthy\": true, \"popularity_score\": 0.0, \"ID\": \"53