n lower to 350\\u00b0F (180\\u00b0C) for 30-40 minutes if in a bake pan.', 'If on a flat sheet 10 minutes on 375\\u00b0F (190\\u00b0C) then set to lower temperature to 350\\u00b0F (180\\u00b0C) for 20-30 minutes.', 'Bread will be done if it sounds hollow when rapped in the middle on the underside of the round loaves.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 2541.3, \"FatContent\": 79.2, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 11.1, \"CholesterolContent\": 5.2, \"SodiumContent\": 2364.7, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 394.7, \"FiberContent\": 15.0, \"SugarContent\": 11.8, \"ProteinContent\": 55.7, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT2H\", \"CookTime\": \"PT30M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT2H30M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 120.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 150.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['water', 'sugar', 'flour', 'salt', 'powdered milk', 'sugar', 'water']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['water', 'sugar', 'flour', 'salt', 'powdered milk', 'sugar', 'water']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['water', 'sugar', 'flour', 'salt', 'powdered milk']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['water', 'sugar', 'flour', 'salt', 'powdered milk']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['water', 'sugar', 'flour', 'salt', 'powdered milk']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['water', 'sugar', 'flour', 'salt', 'powdered milk']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 712.8000000000001, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 99.9, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 1578.8, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 222.8, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 3.9310589068586936, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 28.048636524613386, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Score\": 2, \"WHO_Healthy\": true, \"Energy_kJ\": 10632.7992, \"A_score\": 32, \"C_score\": 10, \"FSA_Score\": 22, \"FSA_Healthy\": false, \"popularity_score\": 5.0, \"ID\": \"34971_foodcom\", \"WHO_binary\": true, \"FSA_binary\": false, \"FSA_binned\": 0, \"popularity_log\