": \"Baked Tanrogans With Cheese Sauce (Manx Scallops)\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['Preheat oven to 350\\u00b0F.', 'Remove scallops from their shells and clean, but do not remove the yellow tip. Reserve shells.', 'Place scallops in an oven-proof dish with the stock, onion, seasoning and bay leaf.', 'Cover and bake for about ten minutes.', 'Lift out the scallops and replace them in their shells.', 'Reserve pan juices for sauce.', 'Melt butter.', 'Stir in flour and cook for one minute.', 'Remove from heat.', 'Add milk and reserved pan juices.', 'Return to heat and bring to a boil.', 'Beat in cream and half of the grated cheese.', 'Pour a little of the sauce into each scallop shell, sprinkle with the rest of the grated cheese, and brown under the broiler.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 226.5, \"FatContent\": 15.3, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 9.4, \"CholesterolContent\": 60.4, \"SodiumContent\": 293.7, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 7.7, \"FiberContent\": 0.4, \"SugarContent\": 1.1, \"ProteinContent\": 14.4, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT10M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT15M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT25M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 10.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 25.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['scallops', 'onion', 'bay leaf', 'butter', 'flour', 'milk', 'cheddar cheese']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['scallops', 'onion', 'bay leaf', 'butter', 'flour', 'milk', 'cheddar cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['scallop', 'onion', 'bay leaf', 'butter', 'flour', 'milk', 'cheddar cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['sea scallop', 'onion', 'bay leaf', 'butter', 'flour', 'milk', 'cheddar cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['sea scallop', 'onion', 'bay leaf', 'butter', 'flour', 'milk', 'cheddar cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['sea scallop', 'onion', 'bay leaf', 'butter', 'flour', 'milk', 'cheddar cheese']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 137.7000000000