/3 of the egg whites into chocolate mixture. Then fold in another 1/3 of the egg whites.  Then fold in the last 1/3.', 'Deposit batter into large non-stick muffin tins - fill 3/4 full.  Ramekins can also be used; simply butter insides and dust with cocoa powder.', 'Push a chocolate lava center into the center of each cake batter.', 'Bake at 375 F for 15 minutes. Do not overbake or you will lose your lava center!', 'Remove from oven, wait 5 minutes, then unmold onto a wire rack to cool.', 'Serve warm. If you need to reheat, pop it in a microwave for 30 seconds.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 589.9, \"FatContent\": 42.1, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 24.9, \"CholesterolContent\": 192.6, \"SodiumContent\": 243.2, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 48.1, \"FiberContent\": 3.5, \"SugarContent\": 34.6, \"ProteinContent\": 7.7, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT1H30M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT15M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H45M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 90.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 105.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['dark semi-sweet chocolate', 'heavy cream', 'butter', 'dark semi-sweet chocolate', 'butter', 'vanilla extract', 'eggs', 'cake flour', 'salt', 'cream of tartar', 'sugar']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['dark semi-sweet chocolate', 'heavy cream', 'butter', 'dark semi-sweet chocolate', 'butter', 'vanilla extract', 'eggs', 'cake flour', 'salt', 'cream of tartar', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['dark semi sweet chocolate', 'heavy cream', 'butter', 'vanilla extract', 'egg', 'cake flour', 'salt', 'cream of tartar', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['dark semi sweet chocolate', 'heavy cream', 'butter', 'vanilla extract', 'egg', 'cake flour', 'salt', 'cream of tartar', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['dark semi sweet chocolate', 'heavy cream', 'butter', 'vanilla extract', 'egg', 'cake flour', 'salt', 'cream of tartar', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonic