gar and vanilla; beat until fluffy.', 'Add the egg whites and beat until smooth (about 2 minutes).', 'Add flour mixture and buttermilk alternately, beating on low speed after each addition just until mixture is combined.', 'Put in prepared pans and bake at 375\\u00b0 for 25 to 30 minutes or until done when tested with toothpick.', 'Cool on wire racks for 10 minutes.', 'Remove from pans to cool completely on wire racks.', 'For frosting: In small bowl, beat 1/2 cup butter until light.', 'Gradually add powdered sugar, beating well.', 'Beat in milk and vanilla.', 'Gradually beat in 3 3/4 to 4 cups more powdered sugar until frosting is right consistency for spreading (makes 3 cups frosting) Spread frosting between layers and over top and sides.', 'Sprinkle top and sides with coconut.', \\\"Note: If you don't have buttermilk you can substitute by combining 1 tablespoon lemon juice and enough milk to make 1 cup.\\\", 'Let stand for 5 minutes.']\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/25/85/6/picTjc0k5.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/25/85/6/picaBsFlE.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 4.5, \"ReviewCount\": 4.0, \"Calories\": 703.4, \"FatContent\": 22.8, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 11.5, \"CholesterolContent\": 32.3, \"SodiumContent\": 218.0, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 122.7, \"FiberContent\": 0.8, \"SugarContent\": 104.8, \"ProteinContent\": 4.9, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT30M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT45M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 45.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['all-purpose flour', 'baking powder', 'baking soda', 'shortening', 'butter', 'sugar', 'vanilla', 'buttermilk', 'butter', 'powdered sugar', 'milk', 'vanilla', 'flaked coconut']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['all-purpose flour', 'baking powder', 'baking soda', 'shortening', 'butte