nd pepper to taste.', 'Spoon vegetables gently into a buttered casserole dish.', 'Cover with seasoned breadcrumbs and melted tablespoon of butter.', 'Place casserole into a 350 degree oven- covered for 10 minutes; remove cover and let crumbs brown- 10 minutes.', 'We like our vegetables with a little bite; not very soft.', 'Pass a long fork into the casserole to test done-ness and this will determine the length of cooking time for you.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 393.8, \"FatContent\": 10.9, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 4.5, \"CholesterolContent\": 15.5, \"SodiumContent\": 503.9, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 67.2, \"FiberContent\": 9.3, \"SugarContent\": 15.1, \"ProteinContent\": 9.2, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT10M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT45M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT55M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 10.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 45.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 55.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['garlic cloves', 'carrots', 'potatoes', 'parsnips', 'parsley', 'thyme', 'olive oil', 'butter', 'sugar']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['garlic cloves', 'carrots', 'potatoes', 'parsnips', 'parsley', 'thyme', 'olive oil', 'butter', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['garlic', 'carrot', 'potato', 'parsnip', 'parsley', 'thyme', 'olive oil', 'butter', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['garlic', 'carrot', 'potato', 'parsnip', 'parsley', 'thyme', 'olive oil', 'butter', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['garlic', 'carrot', 'potato', 'parsnip', 'parsley', 'thyme', 'olive oil', 'butter', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['garlic', 'carrot', 'potato', 'parsnip', 'parsley', 'thyme', 'olive oil', 'butter', 'sugar']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 98.1, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 40.5, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 268.8, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 36.8, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 10.284408329101066, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 24.91112239715592, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Fat_Com