ore time) into the egg white mixture. Gently fold it in to form a batter that can hold its shape.', 'The cookies can be dropped by spoonful onto the baking sheet. Or, transfer the batter to a pastry bag or resealable plastic food storage bag fitted with a large star tip. Pipe kisses that are about 1 1/2 inches wide and 1 inch high onto the parchment paper-lined baking sheets, spacing them at least 1/2 inch apart.', 'Sprinkle the finely chopped or crushed candies evenly over the meringue kisses.', 'Bake for about 3 hours, until dry and crisp. Turn off the oven; let the kisses remain in the oven for 1 hour to dry thoroughly before serving or storing.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 14.0, \"FatContent\": 0.0, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.0, \"CholesterolContent\": 0.0, \"SodiumContent\": 3.1, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 3.3, \"FiberContent\": 0.0, \"SugarContent\": 3.3, \"ProteinContent\": 0.2, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT20M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT4H\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT4H20M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 240.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 260.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"[]\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"[]\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"[]\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"[]\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"[]\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"[]\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 0.0, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 0.0, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 13.2, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 0.8, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 0.0, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 0.0, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Score\": 3, \"WHO_Healthy\": true, \"Energy_kJ\": 58.576, \"A_score\": 0, \"C_score\": 0, \"FSA_Score\": 0, \"FSA_Healthy\": true, \"popularity_score\": 0.0, \"ID\": \"511517_foodcom\", \"WHO_binary\": true, \"FSA_binary\": true, \"FSA_binned\": 3, \"popularity_log\": 0.0, \"cluster\": \"0\", \"pca1\": -1.9129030155975777, \"pca2\":