 5-cup jar with a tight-fitting lid.  Top with layers of candy and oats.  Mix sugars: add to jar.  Top with chips, Cover; give with recipe card as below.', 'Simply cut and paste to a word program with a really nice Christmas or Holiday Picture, print on a 4x6 card or card stock, punch hole in upper corner of card, and thread thin ribbon through hole, tying it around the neck of the jar.', 'Cookies:', '1 jar cookie mix.', '3/4 cup butter, softened.', '2 large egg, beaten.', '1 tsp vanilla.', 'Empty Cookie Mix into large bowl, breaking up brown sugar if clumped.  Work in butter with rubber spatula.  Add eggs and vanilla, stir until well blended.  Drop heaping teaspoonfuls of mixture 2 inches apart on ungreased baking sheets.', 'Bake 12 minutes or until golden brown.  Cool on sheet on wire rack 2 minutes before removing from sheet to rack to cool completely.  Makes 3 dozen cookies.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 59.3, \"FatContent\": 1.6, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.7, \"CholesterolContent\": 0.0, \"SodiumContent\": 62.2, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 9.6, \"FiberContent\": 0.6, \"SugarContent\": 4.8, \"ProteinContent\": 1.7, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": null, \"TotalTime\": \"PT15M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": null, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['flour', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'old fashioned oats', 'brown sugar', 'sugar']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['flour', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'old fashioned oats', 'brown sugar', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['flour', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'oat', 'brown sugar', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['flour', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'rolled oat', 'brown sugar', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['flour', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'rolled oat', 'brown sugar', 'sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['flour', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'rol