lic.  Cook sauce over low heat, stirring often, until thickened.', 'With two forks, shred roasted beef.  Stir meat into the sauce in the skillet and simmer for 30 minutes.', 'Serve as sandwiches over lightly buttered and broiled hamburger buns.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 326.7, \"FatContent\": 10.3, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 4.5, \"CholesterolContent\": 78.7, \"SodiumContent\": 762.1, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 28.9, \"FiberContent\": 2.3, \"SugarContent\": 7.1, \"ProteinContent\": 28.8, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT5M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT2H45M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT2H50M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 5.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 165.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 170.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['onion', 'butter', 'distilled white vinegar', 'chili sauce', 'brown sugar', 'mustard powder', 'Worcestershire sauce', 'fresh ground black pepper', 'salt', 'ground cayenne pepper', 'garlic cloves']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['onion', 'butter', 'distilled white vinegar', 'chili sauce', 'brown sugar', 'mustard powder', 'Worcestershire sauce', 'fresh ground black pepper', 'salt', 'ground cayenne pepper', 'garlic cloves']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['onion', 'butter', 'distilled white vinegar', 'chili sauce', 'brown sugar', 'mustard powder', 'worcestershire sauce', 'black pepper', 'salt', 'cayenne pepper', 'garlic']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['onion', 'butter', 'distilled white vinegar', 'chili sauce', 'brown sugar', 'mustard powder', 'worcestershire sauce', 'black pepper', 'salt', 'cayenne pepper', 'garlic']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['onion', 'butter', 'distilled white vinegar', 'chili sauce', 'brown sugar', 'mustard powder', 'worcestershire sauce', 'black pepper', 'salt', 'cayenne pepper', 'garlic']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['onion', 'butter', 'distilled white vinegar', 'chili sauce', 'brown sugar', 'mustard powder', 'worcestershire sauce', 'blac