re and beat until well combined. Add egg, beat then pour in the milk. Mix until combined. The batter will be rather thin. Fill each well 2/3 of the way full. Bake 20 minutes or until a toothpick comes out clean. Remove cupcakes to wire racks as soon as possible to cool. Frost with Chocolate Rum Cream Cheese Frosting when cool. Garnish with a wedge of lime.', '*This will sour the milk a bit. Do not worry if it looks slightly curdled.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 192.3, \"FatContent\": 8.6, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 5.2, \"CholesterolContent\": 38.7, \"SodiumContent\": 295.8, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 26.8, \"FiberContent\": 0.7, \"SugarContent\": 17.7, \"ProteinContent\": 2.1, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT20M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT35M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 35.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'butter', 'milk', 'rum', 'lime juice', 'baking soda', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'egg']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'butter', 'milk', 'rum', 'lime juice', 'baking soda', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'egg']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'butter', 'milk', 'rum', 'lime juice', 'baking soda', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'egg']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'butter', 'milk', 'rum', 'lime juice', 'baking soda', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'egg']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'butter', 'milk', 'rum', 'lime juice', 'baking soda', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'egg']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['flour', 'sugar', 'butter', 'milk', 'rum', 'lime juice', 'baking soda', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'egg']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 77.39999999999999, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 46.8, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 107.2, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 8.4, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 24.336973478939157, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 40.249609984