tween each).Press either an almond or pistachio onto thetop of ech cookie.', '7.Cook for 10 minutes on the lowest rack in the oven, then move the rack to the middle of the oven and bake an additional 5 minutes.Leave to cool on the baking sheet for at least 5 minutes.', '8.Using a small sieve, sprinkle each cookie with a light dust of powder (icing) sugar.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 3.5, \"ReviewCount\": 2.0, \"Calories\": 145.6, \"FatContent\": 6.8, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.7, \"CholesterolContent\": 35.2, \"SodiumContent\": 11.8, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 19.1, \"FiberContent\": 1.4, \"SugarContent\": 17.3, \"ProteinContent\": 3.6, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT20M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT15M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT35M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 35.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['sugar', 'eggs', 'amaretto liqueur']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['sugar', 'eggs', 'amaretto liqueur']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['sugar', 'egg', 'amaretto liqueur']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['sugar', 'egg', 'cointreau liqueur']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['sugar', 'egg', 'cointreau liqueur']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['sugar', 'egg', 'cointreau liqueur']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 61.2, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 6.3, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 76.4, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 14.4, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 4.326923076923077, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 42.03296703296704, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Score\": 2, \"WHO_Healthy\": true, \"Energy_kJ\": 609.1904, \"A_score\": 4, \"C_score\": 3, \"FSA_Score\": 1, \"FSA_Healthy\": true, \"popularity_score\": 7.0, \"ID\": \"387967_foodcom\", \"WHO_binary\": true, \"FSA_binary\": true, \"FSA_binned\": 2, \"popularity_log\": 2.0794415416798357, \"cluster\": \"0\", \"pca1\": -1.1678752803825823, \"pca2\": 0.4608139141934466, \"protein_kcal\": 1