ces cut side down on the prepared baking pan.  Bake until golden  35-40 minutes.  Transfer to a rack to cool.', 'Meanwhile, in a sauce pan, bring the remaining 4 tablespoons butter, 3/4 cup brown sugar, 1/2 cup cream, 1/2 teaspoon salt and the honey to a boil, stirring.  Whisk until reduced, about 2 minutes.  Let cool slightly  Drizzle the sauce over the warm buns.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 1.0, \"ReviewCount\": 2.0, \"Calories\": 602.3, \"FatContent\": 35.3, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 16.9, \"CholesterolContent\": 123.9, \"SodiumContent\": 553.8, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 69.3, \"FiberContent\": 2.7, \"SugarContent\": 44.1, \"ProteinContent\": 6.2, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT45M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT40M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H25M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 45.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 85.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['tart apples', 'brown sugar', 'light brown sugar', 'butter', 'flour', 'granulated sugar', 'baking powder', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'eggs', 'heavy cream', 'pecans', 'ground cinnamon', 'honey']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['tart apples', 'brown sugar', 'light brown sugar', 'butter', 'flour', 'granulated sugar', 'baking powder', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'eggs', 'heavy cream', 'pecans', 'ground cinnamon', 'honey']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['tart apple', 'brown sugar', 'butter', 'flour', 'sugar', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'egg', 'heavy cream', 'pecan', 'cinnamon', 'honey']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['tart apple', 'brown sugar', 'butter', 'flour', 'sugar', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'egg', 'heavy cream', 'pecan', 'cinnamon', 'honey']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['tart apple', 'brown sugar', 'butter', 'flour', 'sugar', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'egg', 'heavy cream', 'pecan', 'cinnamon', 'honey']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['tart apple', 'brown sugar', 'butter', 'flour', 'sugar', 'baking powder', 'salt', 'egg', 'heavy cream', 'pecan', 'ci