 mushrooms (along with any accumulated juice).', 'Toss until well combined.', 'Serve!']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 4.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 239.7, \"FatContent\": 5.2, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.7, \"CholesterolContent\": 0.0, \"SodiumContent\": 323.7, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 41.1, \"FiberContent\": 4.2, \"SugarContent\": 3.4, \"ProteinContent\": 8.2, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT25M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT40M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 25.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['olive oil', 'white mushrooms', 'onion', 'israeli couscous', 'water', 'coarse salt', 'dried cranberries', 'fresh lime juice', 'Dijon mustard', 'coarse salt', 'ground pepper']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['olive oil', 'white mushrooms', 'onion', 'israeli couscous', 'water', 'coarse salt', 'dried cranberries', 'fresh lime juice', 'Dijon mustard', 'coarse salt', 'ground pepper']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['olive oil', 'mushroom', 'onion', 'couscous', 'water', 'coarse salt', 'cranberry', 'lime juice', 'dijon mustard', 'pepper']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['olive oil', 'mushroom', 'onion', 'couscous', 'water', 'coarse salt', 'cranberry', 'lime juice', 'dijon mustard', 'pepper']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['olive oil', 'mushroom', 'onion', 'couscous', 'water', 'coarse salt', 'cranberry', 'lime juice', 'dijon mustard', 'pepper']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['olive oil', 'mushroom', 'onion', 'couscous', 'water', 'coarse salt', 'cranberry', 'lime juice', 'dijon mustard', 'pepper']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 46.8, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 6.3, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 164.4, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 32.8, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 2.62828535669587, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 19.524405506883607, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Score\": 3, \"WHO_Healthy\": true, \"En