ol. Remove the weight, cover, and refrigerate for several days. Bring to room temperature before serving.', \\\"Onion marmalade complements the pate well. I didn't serve the marmalade.\\\", '*** Make several days in advance ***.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 369.8, \"FatContent\": 32.8, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 11.9, \"CholesterolContent\": 123.3, \"SodiumContent\": 99.9, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 0.5, \"FiberContent\": 0.0, \"SugarContent\": 0.1, \"ProteinContent\": 14.0, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT1H\", \"CookTime\": \"PT2H\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT3H\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 120.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 180.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['chicken liver', 'duck liver', 'duck', 'eggs', 'fresh ground black pepper', 'thyme', 'sherry wine', 'brandy', 'garlic cloves', 'parsley', 'ham', 'bay leaves']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['chicken liver', 'duck liver', 'duck', 'eggs', 'fresh ground black pepper', 'thyme', 'sherry wine', 'brandy', 'garlic cloves', 'parsley', 'ham', 'bay leaves']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['chicken liver', 'duck liver', 'duck', 'egg', 'black pepper', 'thyme', 'sherry wine', 'brandy', 'garlic', 'parsley', 'ham', 'bay leaf']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['chicken liver', 'duck liver', 'duck', 'egg', 'black pepper', 'thyme', 'sherry wine', 'brandy', 'garlic', 'parsley', 'ham', 'bay leaf']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['chicken liver', 'duck liver', 'duck', 'egg', 'black pepper', 'thyme', 'sherry wine', 'brandy', 'garlic', 'parsley', 'ham', 'bay leaf']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['chicken liver', 'other_target_ingredient', 'duck', 'egg', 'black pepper', 'thyme', 'sherry wine', 'brandy', 'garlic', 'parsley', 'ham', 'bay leaf']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 295.2, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 107.1, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 2.0, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 56.0, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 28.961600865332613, \"F