exposed.', 'In a small bowl, mix together the bread crumbs and flour.  Dip each ball first into the beat eggs, then into the bread crumbs.  Repeat for a crunchier texture.  Layer on a lined baking sheet or large platter and refrigerate for 2 to 4 hours before frying.', 'Pour enough oil into a frying pan that is enough to cover half of the height of the balls.  Heat the oil to 375 \\u00b0F.  Carefully drop the stuffed potatoes in the hot oil and fry on each side for about 2 to 3 minutes or until golden brown.  Drain on a plate lined with paper towels and serve immediately.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 123.6, \"FatContent\": 2.5, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.8, \"CholesterolContent\": 22.1, \"SodiumContent\": 133.8, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 19.8, \"FiberContent\": 2.2, \"SugarContent\": 1.9, \"ProteinContent\": 5.2, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT4H40M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT35M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT5H15M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 280.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 35.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 315.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['russet potatoes', 'milk', 'ground beef', 'onion', 'garlic cloves', 'tomato sauce', 'white wine', 'pimientos', 'ground cumin', 'paprika', 'salt', 'pepper', 'flour', 'eggs']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['russet potatoes', 'milk', 'ground beef', 'onion', 'garlic cloves', 'tomato sauce', 'white wine', 'pimientos', 'ground cumin', 'paprika', 'salt', 'pepper', 'flour', 'eggs']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['russet potato', 'milk', 'beef', 'onion', 'garlic', 'tomato sauce', 'white wine', 'pimiento', 'cumin', 'paprika', 'salt', 'pepper', 'flour', 'egg']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['russet potato', 'milk', 'beef', 'onion', 'garlic', 'tomato sauce', 'white wine', 'pimiento', 'cumin', 'paprika', 'salt', 'pepper', 'flour', 'egg']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['russet potato', 'milk', 'beef', 'onion', 'garlic', 'tomato sauce', 'white wine', 'pimiento', 'cumin', 