 oil and season with sea salt. Scatter over 2tbsp of the Cajun seasoning and mix. (You're likely to have made more than you need, so store the rest in a jar for another time - it will keep for about 2 months).\\\", 'Barbecue the chips on a rack; place in a single layer and cook for 8-10 minutes, turning a few times until lightly charred and cooked through. If you prefer, roast them in an oven, gas 6, 200C, fan 180C for 10-12 minutes.', 'Serve with a dipping sauce of sour cream mixed with some snipped chives and a sprinkling of chives.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 287.2, \"FatContent\": 4.2, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.7, \"CholesterolContent\": 0.0, \"SodiumContent\": 142.2, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 60.0, \"FiberContent\": 10.2, \"SugarContent\": 14.1, \"ProteinContent\": 5.3, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT10M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT11M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT21M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 10.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 11.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 21.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['pepper', 'sage', 'oregano', 'thyme', 'paprika', 'cayenne', 'sugar', 'garlic powder', 'sweet potato', 'sour cream', 'chives']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['pepper', 'sage', 'oregano', 'thyme', 'paprika', 'cayenne', 'sugar', 'garlic powder', 'sweet potato', 'sour cream', 'chives']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['pepper', 'sage', 'oregano', 'thyme', 'paprika', 'cayenne', 'sugar', 'garlic powder', 'sweet potato', 'sour cream', 'chive']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['pepper', 'sage', 'oregano', 'thyme', 'paprika', 'cayenne', 'sugar', 'garlic powder', 'sweet potato', 'sour cream', 'chive']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['pepper', 'sage', 'oregano', 'thyme', 'paprika', 'cayenne', 'sugar', 'garlic powder', 'sweet potato', 'sour cream', 'chive']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['pepper', 'sage', 'oregano', 'thyme', 'paprika', 'cayenne', 'sugar', 'garlic powder', 'sweet potato', 'sour c