k.', 'To Assemble: When the cake has cooled slice it through the centre into two halves.', 'Spread the lemon curd evenly over the bottom slice.', 'Place the second half on top and spread the lemon icing over the cake.', 'Slice the cake into 5cm squares and place them in the refrigerator for at least 1 hour before serving.', 'Alternatively you can simply dust the slice with a little icing sugar.', 'Lemon Curd: Whisk the egg yolks and caster sugar together until they are thick.', 'Place the lemon zest, juice and butter in a pan over a moderate-low heat.', 'Stir in the egg mixture and cook the curd slowly, while stirring it with a wooden spoon until it thickens.', 'Allow the curd to cool before using.', 'Refrigerate the curd in a sealed container until ready to use.', 'Lemon Icing: Beat the butter with the icing sugar until creamy, mix in the lemon juice until well combined.', 'The icing should be thick but of a spreadable consistency.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 813.6, \"FatContent\": 45.0, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 27.1, \"CholesterolContent\": 284.1, \"SodiumContent\": 44.4, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 96.9, \"FiberContent\": 1.1, \"SugarContent\": 65.7, \"ProteinContent\": 8.6, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT20M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT1H\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H20M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 80.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['unsalted butter', 'caster sugar', 'self raising flour', 'eggs', 'lemon, zest of', 'unsalted butter', 'icing sugar', 'lemon juice', 'unsalted butter', 'caster sugar', 'lemon, juice and zest of']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['unsalted butter', 'caster sugar', 'self raising flour', 'eggs', 'lemon, zest of', 'unsalted butter', 'icing sugar', 'lemon juice', 'unsalted butter', 'caster sugar', 'lemon, juice and zest of']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['unsalted butter', 'caster sugar', 'self raising flour', 'egg', 'l