 minutes or until it reaches 170 degrees and juices run clear.', '(Center of meat roll will be pink because of the ham.) Sprinkle remaining cheese over top of roll; return to oven for 5 minutes or until cheese melts.', 'Remove to a platter to serve.', '6 servings Source: Better Homes and Gardens Serving Ideas: I like to serve this with buttered pasta with Italian seasonings, Parmesan cheese, salt, and pepper mixed in, baked potato bread from my bread machine, mandarin orange tossed salad, and dessert.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 11.0, \"Calories\": 453.6, \"FatContent\": 26.6, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 11.8, \"CholesterolContent\": 202.1, \"SodiumContent\": 874.3, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 6.0, \"FiberContent\": 0.7, \"SugarContent\": 1.4, \"ProteinContent\": 44.9, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT0S\", \"CookTime\": \"PT1H15M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H15M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 0.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 75.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 75.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['eggs', 'tomato juice', 'fresh parsley', 'dried oregano', 'salt', 'pepper', 'garlic clove', 'lean ground beef', 'deli ham', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['eggs', 'tomato juice', 'fresh parsley', 'dried oregano', 'salt', 'pepper', 'garlic clove', 'lean ground beef', 'deli ham', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['egg', 'tomato juice', 'parsley', 'oregano', 'salt', 'pepper', 'garlic', 'beef', 'ham', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['egg', 'tomato juice', 'parsley', 'oregano', 'salt', 'pepper', 'garlic', 'beef', 'ham', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['egg', 'tomato juice', 'parsley', 'oregano', 'salt', 'pepper', 'garlic', 'beef', 'ham', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['egg', 'tomato juice', 'parsley', 'oregano', 'salt', 'pepper', 'garlic', 'beef', 'ham', 'mozzarella cheese']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 239.4, \"EnergyFr