.7, \"FatContent\": 42.0, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 12.5, \"CholesterolContent\": 194.8, \"SodiumContent\": 934.4, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 33.1, \"FiberContent\": 1.7, \"SugarContent\": 28.0, \"ProteinContent\": 46.1, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT20M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT20M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT40M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['butter', 'shallot', 'garlic cloves', 'Bourbon', 'brown sugar', 'honey', 'dry mustard', 'ancho chili', 'chili sauce', 'barbecue sauce', 'chicken wings', 'Bourbon']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['butter', 'shallot', 'garlic cloves', 'Bourbon', 'brown sugar', 'honey', 'dry mustard', 'ancho chili', 'chili sauce', 'barbecue sauce', 'chicken wings', 'Bourbon']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['butter', 'shallot', 'garlic', 'bourbon', 'brown sugar', 'honey', 'dry mustard', 'ancho chili', 'chili sauce', 'barbecue sauce', 'chicken wing']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['butter', 'shallot', 'garlic', 'bourbon', 'brown sugar', 'honey', 'dry mustard', 'green chili', 'chili sauce', 'barbecue sauce', 'chicken wing']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['butter', 'shallot', 'garlic', 'bourbon', 'brown sugar', 'honey', 'dry mustard', 'green chili', 'chili sauce', 'barbecue sauce', 'chicken wing']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['butter', 'shallot', 'garlic', 'bourbon', 'brown sugar', 'honey', 'dry mustard', 'green chili', 'chili sauce', 'barbecue sauce', 'chicken wing']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 378.0, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 112.5, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 132.4, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 184.4, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 15.631513130471028, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 52.52188411838266, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Score\": 0, \"WHO_Healthy\": false, \"Energy_kJ\": 3011.2248000000004, \"A_score\": 34, \"C_score\": 6, \"FSA_Score\": 28, \"FSA_Healthy\": false, \"popularity_score\": 0.0, \"ID\": \"399598_foodcom\", \"WHO_binary\": false, \"FSA_binary\": false, \"FSA_binned\": 0, \"popularity_log\": 0.0, \"cluster\": \"3\", \"pca1\": 2.548573307678427, \"pca2\": -0.3430174522824567, \"protein_kcal\": 184.4, \"fat_kcal\": 378.0, \"carb_kcal\": 132.4, \"protein_pct\": 26.540011514104783, \"fat_pct\": 54.40414507772021, \"net_carb_pct\": 19.055843408175015, \"satiety_score_raw\": 15.45265055824096, \"satiety\": 18.41921157905838, \"nutrient_density_raw\": 16.77254039447377, \"nutrient_density\": 53.31597304466088}, {\"RecipeId\": 200864, \"Name\": \"Cheat's French Cassoulet - Crock Pot or Le Creuset\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['Heat olive oil in a large skillet - fry the bacon until nearly crisp & then add the onions, garlic, & carrots. Cook over a high heat until they are just soft on the outside & turning a golden colour. Drain well & remove from pan. Add to crock pot or Le Creuset casserole dish.', 'Add sausages and brown - remove & add to onion mixture.', 'Add pork chop pieces & brown - remove and add to above mixture.', 'Make up chicken stock and add wine. Mix tomatoes in with stock & teaspoon of sugar.', 'Pour stock and tomatoes over the cassoulet in crock pot or le creuset - add bouquet garni & give everything a good stir!', 'Add the beans and stir well again.', 'Sprinkle breadcrumbs on top and cook for up to 6 hours on high in crock pot or in le cresuet for 3 hours in a slow oven with the lid on, 150C/300\\u00b0F.', \\\"Half an hour before serving, take lid of le creuset to brown the top. It's difficult to brown in a crock pot, but it's not that essential to brown the top, as the reason behind the breadcrumbs is to soak up some of the juice & make a crust on top! If your crock pot is the type which you can put under the grill, then do so!\\\", 'Serve with mountains of fluffy mashed potatoes & stir-fried Savoy Cabbage.', 'NOTE ON SAUSAGES:', 'Try to use very good quality high meat content sausages; in France Toulouse sausages are mainly used - they generally have a meat content of at least 85%. Good quality English style sausages are also good - I have a recipe posted for some English sausages: Recipe #190045.', 'However,  any kind of sausage can be used and in the past I have used: Choritzo, Italian Style, Chipolatas etc.', \\\"The Pork chops can be replaced with chicken pieces, lamb steaks or Confit D'Canard - preserved duck, if you are lucky enought to have some!\\\"]\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/20/08/64/J7ElqlEcRDW8gUM7ptYX-P20606711.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/20/08/64/picTMKI2W.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/20/08/64/picg0KGgv.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/20/08/64/picFX8mms.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/20/08/64/piciYcnlR.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/20/08/64/picheCFCi.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/20/08/64/picL4NS2Y.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/20/08/64/picHJfnTh.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/20/08/64/picYDUP3r.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/20/08/64/piceHE8vl.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 23.0, \"Calories\": 559.7, \"FatContent\": 35.5, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 10.9, \"CholesterolContent\": 84.0, \"SodiumContent\": 1002.5, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 27.7, \"FiberContent\": 4.0, \"SugarContent\": 10.4, \"ProteinContent\": 23.1, \"s