on sticks, cloves, lemon peel, lemon juice, and ginger in deep 2-quart saucepan just large enough to hold the pears.  Bring to a boil.  Reduce heat to low; simmer 5 minutes.  Add pears; cover and simmer about 15 minutes or until just tender when pierced.', 'Remove pears from saucepan, reserving liquid.  Stand pears upright in bowl; cool.  Cover.  Refrigerate until ready to serve.', 'Meanwhile, bring reserved liquid to boil in same saucepan.  Cook on medium-high heat about 15 minutes or until syrupy.  Strain and cool.  Cover.  Refrigerate until ready to serve.', 'To serve, stand pears on individual dessert plates.  Spoon some of the syrup over each pear.  Sprinkle lightly with cinnamon.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 151.1, \"FatContent\": 0.2, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.0, \"CholesterolContent\": 0.0, \"SodiumContent\": 7.2, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 39.8, \"FiberContent\": 5.2, \"SugarContent\": 29.6, \"ProteinContent\": 0.7, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT0S\", \"CookTime\": \"PT40M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT40M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 0.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['apple cider', 'brandy', 'brown sugar', 'cinnamon sticks', 'whole cloves', 'lemon peel', 'fresh lemon juice', 'ground ginger', 'bosc pears', 'ground cinnamon']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['apple cider', 'brandy', 'brown sugar', 'cinnamon sticks', 'whole cloves', 'lemon peel', 'fresh lemon juice', 'ground ginger', 'bosc pears', 'ground cinnamon']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['apple cider', 'brandy', 'brown sugar', 'cinnamon stick', 'whole clove', 'lemon peel', 'lemon juice', 'ginger', 'pear', 'cinnamon']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['apple cider', 'brandy', 'brown sugar', 'cinnamon stick', 'garlic clove', 'lemon peel', 'lemon juice', 'ginger', 'pear', 'cinnamon']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['apple cider', 'brandy', 'brown sugar', 'cinnamon stic