n a pot and cook 2 minutes over medium heat until crisp.', 'Transfer to a plate and set aside.', 'Add the onion and celery and saute over medium-low heat for 5 minutes or until onions are translucent and celery softens.', 'Sprinkle flour over the mixture and stir into a paste.', 'Add clam juice, potato and thyme.', 'Increase heat and bring ingredients to a boil.', 'Reduce to low and simmer for 15 minutes, or until potatoes are tender.', 'Add clams and stir in cream.', 'Continue to simmer for 5 minutes until thick and creamy.', 'Add salt, pepper and Tabasco sauce.', 'Spoon the chowder into the bread bowl and garnish with salt pork or bacon.', 'Serve hot.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 4.0, \"ReviewCount\": 2.0, \"Calories\": 561.9, \"FatContent\": 19.2, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 10.0, \"CholesterolContent\": 72.2, \"SodiumContent\": 1117.7, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 78.9, \"FiberContent\": 4.3, \"SugarContent\": 8.8, \"ProteinContent\": 18.0, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT20M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT30M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT50M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 50.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['salt pork', 'bacon', 'onion', 'celery', 'potato', 'all-purpose flour', 'dried thyme', 'canned clams', 'heavy cream', 'Tabasco sauce']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['salt pork', 'bacon', 'onion', 'celery', 'potato', 'all-purpose flour', 'dried thyme', 'canned clams', 'heavy cream', 'Tabasco sauce']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['pork', 'bacon', 'onion', 'celery', 'potato', 'all purpose flour', 'thyme', 'clam', 'heavy cream', 'tabasco sauce']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['pork', 'bacon', 'onion', 'celery', 'potato', 'all purpose flour', 'thyme', 'clam', 'heavy cream', 'tabasco sauce']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['pork', 'bacon', 'onion', 'celery', 'potato', 'all purpose flour', 'thyme', 'clam', 'heavy cream', 'tabasco sauce']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\