rown, oil is hot enough.', 'Carefully drop table spoons full of potato and egg white mixture in the hot oil, patting the mount down a bit with back of spoon or (metal) spatula.', 'Cook for 30 seconds, or until edges of latkes turn golden brown.', 'Turn latkes and add remaining 1 tablespoon of oil, or more if necessary.', 'Latkes are ready when second side is golden brown.', 'Check for doneness, inside should be soft, while outside crisp.', 'Latkes may be served immediately or can be kept warm in preheated, and covered, ovenproof dish in 200\\u00baF oven.', 'Serve each latke with a spoonful of apple sauce.', 'Top with dollop of sour cream or plain yogurt.', 'Top with sprinkle of cinnamon (omit when apple sauce was cooked with cinnamon stick).', 'Enjoy!']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 646.8, \"FatContent\": 45.9, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 18.3, \"CholesterolContent\": 52.6, \"SodiumContent\": 316.8, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 54.4, \"FiberContent\": 6.0, \"SugarContent\": 15.9, \"ProteinContent\": 8.7, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT40M\", \"CookTime\": null, \"TotalTime\": \"PT40M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": null, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['baking potatoes', 'kosher salt', 'pepper', 'granny smith apples', 'water', 'lemon peel', 'cinnamon stick', 'sour cream', 'plain yogurt']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['baking potatoes', 'kosher salt', 'pepper', 'granny smith apples', 'water', 'lemon peel', 'cinnamon stick', 'sour cream', 'plain yogurt']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['baking potato', 'kosher salt', 'pepper', 'granny smith apple', 'water', 'lemon peel', 'cinnamon stick', 'sour cream', 'yogurt']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['baking potato', 'kosher salt', 'pepper', 'granny smith apple', 'water', 'lemon peel', 'cinnamon stick', 'sour cream', 'yogurt']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['baking potato', 'kosher salt', 'pep