ted Cauliflower With Lemon Brown Butter\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['In a small pan, heat oil until rippling; add sage and cook, while stirring, until crisped, about 2 minutes.', 'Drain on paper toweling and transfer oil to a large bowl.', 'Let sage cool, then crumble into a small bowl; stir in coarse salt and set aside.', 'Meanwhile, preheat oven to 375 degrees F; place a roasting pan, with about an inch of water on bottom of oven.', 'Add cauliflower to bowl of oil and season with table salt; toss to coat.', 'Spread cauliflower out on 2 baking sheets and bake until lightly browned, about 20 to 30 minutes.', 'In the meantime, melt butter in a small pan over medium heat until foamy.', 'Once foam subsides, stir often, and once solids are browned, turn off heat and squeeze all the lemon juice into pan and stir well.', 'Transfer cauliflower to a bowl, pour butter on top, add lemon zest, season with about half the sage salt, toss; taste and add more sage salt as needed.']\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/40/48/99/picP6urMJ.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/40/48/99/picdvzHln.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 154.6, \"FatContent\": 12.8, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 5.2, \"CholesterolContent\": 18.3, \"SodiumContent\": 984.3, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 9.3, \"FiberContent\": 3.7, \"SugarContent\": 3.5, \"ProteinContent\": 3.5, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT20M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT40M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 20.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 40.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['olive oil', 'fresh sage leaf', 'coarse salt', 'cauliflower', 'table salt', 'unsalted butter', 'lemon']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['olive oil', 'fresh sage leaf', 'coarse salt', 'cauliflower', 'table salt', 'unsalted butter', 'lemon']\", \"ingredie