, bacon, onion, carrot, celery and garlic. Saut\\u00e9 until onion is translucent.', 'Add all meat. Cook and stir until thoroughly cooked.', \\\"Raise heat and add wine, beef broth and mushrooms. Tasting occasionally cook and stir. If wine is starting to overpower the flavor it's a good time for step four.\\\", 'Turn the heat down and add salt, pepper, basil, oregano, red pepper flakes and nutmeg.', 'Cover and cook for 20 minutes.', 'Add crushed tomatoes and bring back to a boil.', 'Cover partially and simmer slowly for three hours.', 'Remove from heat and strain liquid using a colander and a large bowl.', 'Put liquid in a defatting cup and let sit until the fat separates.', 'Put meat and liquid back into stock pot and bring back to a boil.', 'Slowing stir in milk, bring back to a boil.', 'Reduce heat and simmer uncovered 20-30 minutes.', 'Serve over pasta.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 591.0, \"FatContent\": 38.7, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 13.7, \"CholesterolContent\": 102.3, \"SodiumContent\": 1820.0, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 20.4, \"FiberContent\": 2.9, \"SugarContent\": 10.2, \"ProteinContent\": 33.7, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT4H\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT4H15M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 240.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 255.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['olive oil', 'bacon', 'onion', 'celery', 'carrot', 'garlic clove', 'cremini mushrooms', 'ground beef', 'mild Italian sausage', 'beef broth', 'white wine', 'stewed tomatoes', 'salt', 'black pepper', 'dried basil', 'dried oregano', 'red pepper flakes', 'nutmeg', '2% low-fat milk']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['olive oil', 'bacon', 'onion', 'celery', 'carrot', 'garlic clove', 'cremini mushrooms', 'ground beef', 'mild Italian sausage', 'beef broth', 'white wine', 'stewed tomatoes', 'salt', 'black pepper', 'dried basil', 'dried oregano', 'red pepper flakes', 'nutmeg', '2% low-fat milk']\"