 mixture may separate, but don\\u2019t be alarmed.', 'On low speed, add the chocolate and mix to blend; then add the water, increase mixer speed to medium, and beat until the mixture is homogenous.', 'Remove the bowl from the mixer and, using a large rubber spatula, fold in the flour.', 'Spoon enough batter into the molds to almost fill them and bake the financiers for 15-18 minutes or until they feel springy to the touch and a knife inserted in the center comes out clean.', 'Transfer the pans to a rack; cool for 3 minutes, then run a small blunt knife around the edges and unmold the cookies.', 'Turn the cookies upright and cool them to room temperature.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 88.9, \"FatContent\": 6.0, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 3.5, \"CholesterolContent\": 45.5, \"SodiumContent\": 11.4, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 7.8, \"FiberContent\": 0.1, \"SugarContent\": 5.7, \"ProteinContent\": 1.3, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT45M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT18M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H3M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 45.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 18.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 63.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['bittersweet chocolate', 'eggs', 'sugar', 'sugar', 'unsalted butter', 'water', 'water', 'all-purpose flour', 'all-purpose flour']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['bittersweet chocolate', 'eggs', 'sugar', 'sugar', 'unsalted butter', 'water', 'water', 'all-purpose flour', 'all-purpose flour']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['chocolate', 'egg', 'sugar', 'unsalted butter', 'water', 'all purpose flour']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['bittersweet chocolate', 'egg', 'sugar', 'unsalted butter', 'water', 'all purpose flour']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['bittersweet chocolate', 'egg', 'sugar', 'unsalted butter', 'water', 'all purpose flour']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['bittersweet chocolate', 'egg', 'sugar', 'unsalted butter', 'water', 'all purpose flour']\", \"Ener