 cooled chocolate.', 'When thoroughly blended fold in the crushed biscuits and flour with a metal spoon.', 'Put the egg whites into a clean, grease free bowl and whisk until stiff peaks form.', 'Whisk in the remaining tbsp of sugar to make a stiff, glossy meringue; then fold into the cake mixture in 3 batches.', 'Transfer the mixture to the prepared tin, then bake for 25 - 30 minutes or until just firm to the touch.', 'Let the torta cool in the tin for 10 minutes then remove from the tin and transfer to a wire rack to cool.', 'Dust with icing sugar and serve slightly warm or at room temperature with whipped cream and fresh berries.  (I think a good home-made vanilla ice cream would be good with it).']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 311.2, \"FatContent\": 21.4, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 12.8, \"CholesterolContent\": 108.9, \"SodiumContent\": 31.8, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 30.4, \"FiberContent\": 2.9, \"SugarContent\": 18.6, \"ProteinContent\": 5.5, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT25M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT35M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT1H\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 25.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 35.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 60.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['dark chocolate', 'amaretto liqueur', 'unsalted butter', 'caster sugar', 'caster sugar', 'eggs', 'amaretti', 'plain flour', 'icing sugar']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['dark chocolate', 'amaretto liqueur', 'unsalted butter', 'caster sugar', 'caster sugar', 'eggs', 'amaretti', 'plain flour', 'icing sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['dark chocolate', 'amaretto liqueur', 'unsalted butter', 'caster sugar', 'egg', 'amaretti', 'plain flour', 'powdered sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['bittersweet chocolate', 'cointreau liqueur', 'unsalted butter', 'caster sugar', 'egg', 'amaretti', 'plain flour', 'powdered sugar']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['bittersweet chocolate', 'cointreau liqueur', 'unsalted butter', 'caster sugar', 'e