s.', 'Invert onto individual dessert plates and carefully peel off paper. Serve warm with whipped cream or ice cream next to each cake and a few fresh raspberries.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 4.0, \"ReviewCount\": 2.0, \"Calories\": 434.0, \"FatContent\": 34.2, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 20.4, \"CholesterolContent\": 182.1, \"SodiumContent\": 38.4, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 31.6, \"FiberContent\": 4.2, \"SugarContent\": 20.3, \"ProteinContent\": 7.0, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT1H30M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT1H20M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT2H50M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 90.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 80.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 170.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['heavy cream', 'unsalted butter', 'Amaretto', 'fresh raspberries', 'bittersweet chocolate chips', 'unsalted butter', 'eggs', 'sugar', 'all-purpose flour', 'all-purpose flour', 'ice cream']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['heavy cream', 'unsalted butter', 'Amaretto', 'fresh raspberries', 'bittersweet chocolate chips', 'unsalted butter', 'eggs', 'sugar', 'all-purpose flour', 'all-purpose flour', 'ice cream']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['heavy cream', 'unsalted butter', 'amaretto', 'raspberry', 'bittersweet chocolate chip', 'egg', 'sugar', 'all purpose flour', 'ice cream']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['heavy cream', 'unsalted butter', 'amaretto', 'raspberry', 'chocolate chip', 'egg', 'sugar', 'all purpose flour', 'ice cream']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['heavy cream', 'unsalted butter', 'amaretto', 'raspberry', 'chocolate chip', 'egg', 'sugar', 'all purpose flour', 'ice cream']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['heavy cream', 'unsalted butter', 'amaretto', 'raspberry', 'chocolate chip', 'egg', 'sugar', 'all purpose flour', 'ice cream']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 307.8, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 183.6, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 126.4, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 28.0, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 42.30414746543779, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 70.9216589861