er of each shortcake to flatten it a bit and create an indentation for filling. I like to leave them irregularly shaped instead of perfectly round.', 'Bake for 12-13 minutes, or until the tops are just starting to turn golden.', \\\"After they've cooled for a bit, slice them in half horizontally. Use a combination of any of your favorite fillings: lightly mashed fresh fruit, vanilla pudding, mascarpone cheese, chocolate sauce. My son likes to put a fruit layer and a whipped cream or pudding layer in the center, then add the top half, and then top with a fruit layer and lots of whipped cream.\\\", '*****You can also make a savory version of these shortcakes by omitting the sugar and vanilla, and adding parmesan cheese and a dash of garlic or onion powder. Top with olives, refried beans, sour cram, and salsa or greek salad.*****.']\", \"Images\": \"['https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/26/65/18/picpM5zWy.jpg', 'https://img.sndimg.com/food/image/upload/w_555,h_416,c_fit,fl_progressive,q_95/v1/img/recipes/26/65/18/picipbk81.jpg']\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 4.5, \"ReviewCount\": 2.0, \"Calories\": 171.6, \"FatContent\": 6.3, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 1.2, \"CholesterolContent\": 2.6, \"SodiumContent\": 476.9, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 25.3, \"FiberContent\": 0.7, \"SugarContent\": 5.1, \"ProteinContent\": 3.2, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT12M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT27M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 12.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 27.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['flour', 'baking powder', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'sugar', 'white vinegar', 'milk', 'vanilla']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['flour', 'baking powder', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'sugar', 'white vinegar', 'milk', 'vanilla']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['flour', 'baking powder', 'baking soda', 'salt', 'sugar', 'white vinegar', 'milk', 'vanilla']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['flour', '