, and salt in a small saucepan; cover. Heat to boiling; uncover; boil gently, until mixture registers 242 degrees F on a candy thermometer, or until a small amount of the hot syrup falls, thread-like, from spoon.', 'While syrup cooks, beat egg whites with cream of tartar in a large bowl until stiff peaks form when beaters are removed. Pour hot syrup onto egg whites in a very thin stream, beating all the time at high speed, until frosting is stiff and glossy. Beat in the 1/2 teaspoon vanilla.', 'Pink Mountain Cream Frosting:', 'Follow basic recipe for White Mountain Cream Frosting, using 1/2 cup maraschino cherry liquid in place of water; add a few drops of red food coloring together with the 1/2 teaspoon vanilla to tint frosting a delicate pink. Add more red food coloring if you prefer a deeper shade.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 3.0, \"ReviewCount\": 2.0, \"Calories\": 146.4, \"FatContent\": 0.1, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.0, \"CholesterolContent\": 0.0, \"SodiumContent\": 109.1, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 36.1, \"FiberContent\": 0.0, \"SugarContent\": 28.9, \"ProteinContent\": 1.8, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT5M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT25M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT30M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 5.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 25.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['granulated sugar', 'light corn syrup', 'water', 'salt', 'cream of tartar', 'vanilla extract']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['granulated sugar', 'light corn syrup', 'water', 'salt', 'cream of tartar', 'vanilla extract']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['sugar', 'light corn syrup', 'water', 'salt', 'cream of tartar', 'vanilla extract']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['sugar', 'light corn syrup', 'water', 'salt', 'cream of tartar', 'vanilla extract']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['sugar', 'light corn syrup', 'water', 'salt', 'cream of tartar', 'vanilla extract']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['sugar', 'light corn syru