of the grated cheese.', \\\"(Note:  you may substitute any 'cream of' soup if you have taste preferences.).\\\", 'Pour sauce over noodles and turkey and stir gently to blend.', 'Spread remaining grated cheese over top and sprinkle generously with paprika to taste.  We like a lot so that it makes a nice crispy crust when the cheese bubbles.', 'Bake in oven for thirty minutes or until bubbly.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 0.0, \"ReviewCount\": 0.0, \"Calories\": 808.3, \"FatContent\": 42.3, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 23.4, \"CholesterolContent\": 132.1, \"SodiumContent\": 1135.1, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 61.3, \"FiberContent\": 2.2, \"SugarContent\": 3.1, \"ProteinContent\": 44.4, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT15M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT30M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT45M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 30.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 45.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['macaroni', 'sour cream', 'pesto sauce', 'cheddar cheese', 'paprika']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['macaroni', 'sour cream', 'pesto sauce', 'cheddar cheese', 'paprika']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['elbow macaroni', 'sour cream', 'pesto sauce', 'cheddar cheese', 'paprika']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['elbow macaroni', 'sour cream', 'pesto sauce', 'cheddar cheese', 'paprika']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['elbow macaroni', 'sour cream', 'pesto sauce', 'cheddar cheese', 'paprika']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['elbow macaroni', 'sour cream', 'pesto sauce', 'cheddar cheese', 'paprika']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 380.7, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 210.6, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 245.2, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 177.6, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 26.05468266732649, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 47.09884943709019, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Score\": 0, \"WHO_Healthy\": false, \"Energy_kJ\": 3381.9272, \"A_score\": 30, \"C_score\": 7, \"FSA_Score\": 23, \"FSA_Healthy\": false, \"popularity_score\": 0.0, \"ID\": \"199502_foodcom\", \"WHO_binary\": false, \"FSA_binary\": false, \"FSA_binned\": 0, \"popularity_log\": 0.0, \"cluster\": \"3\", \"pca1\": 2.416631396266866, \"pca2\": -1.3002259987461997, \"protein_kcal\": 177.6, \"fat_kcal\": 380.7, \"carb_kcal\": 245.2, \"protein_pct\": 22.10329807093964, \"fat_pct\": 47.380211574362164, \"net_carb_pct\": 30.516490354698195, \"satiety_score_raw\": 11.764535507069818, \"satiety\": 16.640340880759545, \"nutrient_density_raw\": 19.429224822183343, \"nutrient_density\": 56.0243278303298}, {\"RecipeId\": 235481, \"Name\": \"Smorgastrata\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['Make each filling individually, stirring ingredients together until combined well. Season each filling with salt and pepper.  You should have three separate bowls of filling; one egg, one cream cheese, one herb, and one bowl for the topping.', 'Stack 4 bread slices together and with a serrated knife trim crusts from bread. Stack and trim remaining 36 bread slices in same manner.', 'On a baking sheet lined with parchment paper or wax paper arrange 8 bread slices side by side in 2 rows of 4 slices each to form a rectangle. Top rectangle with half of egg salad filling, spreading evenly, and cover with 8 more bread slices in same manner, pressing gently on top and sides to form an even layer.', 'Top second layer of bread with half of salmon filling, spreading evenly, and cover with 8 bread slices in same manner to form an even layer.', 'Top third layer of bread with all of cream cheese filling, spreading evenly, and cover with 8 bread slices in same manner to form an even layer.', 'Make layers with remaining salmon filling, remaining 8 bread slices, and remaining egg salad filling in same manner, ending with egg salad. Chill torte, covered with plastic wrap, at least 12 hours and up to 2 days.', 'Make topping:', 'In a bowl stir together herbs until combined well.', 'Trim sides of torte and sprinkle topping over egg salad layer.', 'Serve torte cut into small pieces.  Makes 20 half-sandwiches or 40 bite-size quarters.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 4.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 631.7, \"FatContent\": 36.0, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 16.5, \"CholesterolContent\": 234.5, \"SodiumContent\": 971.0, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 56.8, \"FiberContent\": 2.6, \"SugarContent\": 6.3, \"ProteinContent\": 20.0, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT35M\", \"CookTime\": \"PT2H\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT2H35M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 35.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 120.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 155.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['hard-boiled eggs', 'mayonnaise', 'scallions', 'capers', 'smoked salmon', 'creme fraiche', 'fresh lemon juice', 'unsalted butter', 'fresh herbs', 'fresh parsley leaves', 'fresh dill sprig', 'fresh chives']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['hard-boiled eggs', 'mayonnaise', 'scallions', 'capers', 'smoked salmon', 'creme fraiche', 'fresh lemon juice', 'unsalted butter', 'fresh herbs', 'fresh parsley leaves', 'fresh dill sprig', 'fresh chives']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['egg', 'mayonnaise', 'scallion', 'caper', 'salmon', 'creme fraiche', 'lemon juice', 'unsalted butter', 'herb', 'parsley leaf', 'dill sprig', 'chive']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['egg', 'mayonnaise', 'scallion', 'caper', 'salmon', 'creme fraiche', 'lemon juice', 'unsalted butter', 'herb', 'parsley leaf', 'mint sprig', 'chive']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['egg', 'mayonnaise', 'scallion', 'caper', 'salmon', 'creme fraiche', 'lemon juice', 'unsalted butter', 'herb', 'parsley leaf', 'mint sprig', 'chive']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['egg', 'mayonnaise', 'scallion', 'caper', 'salmon', 'creme fraiche', 'lemon juice', 'unsalted butter', 'herb', 'parsley leaf', 'mint sprig', 'chive']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 324.0, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 148.5, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 227.2, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 80.0, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 23.50799430109229, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 51.29016938420136, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Score\": 0, \"WHO_Healthy\": false, \"Energy_kJ\": 2643.0328000000004, \"A_score\": 28, \"C_score\": 7, \"FSA_Score\": 21, \"FSA_Healthy\": false, \"popularity_score\": 4.0, \"ID\": \"235481_foodcom\", \"WHO_binary\": false, \"FSA_binary\": false, \"FSA_binned\": 0, \"popularity_log\": 1.6094379124341003, \"cluster\": \"1\", \"pca1\": 1.132848532750082, \"pca2\": -0.43587377534474464, \"protein_kcal\": 80.0, \"fat_kcal\": 324.0, \"carb_kcal\": 227.2, \"protein_pct\": 12.674271229404308, \"fat_pct\": 51.33079847908745, \"net_carb_pct\": 35.99493029150823, \"satiety_score_raw\": 7.291091040460659, \"satiety\": 14.482686043069174, \"nutrient_density_raw\": 6.19732833980337, \"nutrient_density\": 42.53508169038625}, {\"RecipeId\": 224807, \"Name\": \"Sopa De Pasta or Sopa De Fideos\", \"RecipeInstructions\": \"['Break the pasta into 1 inch pieces.', 'In food processor, combine the tomatoes, onions, garlic, and chipotle.  Process until smooth.', 'In heavy soup pan, heat oil to med heat.  Add pasta and cook, stirring, until pasta turns golden about 5 to 7 minutes.', 'Then add the tomato mix and broth.  Increase the heat to med high and bring to a boil.  Cook uncovered until the pasta is a la dente. That should be about 5 minutes [angel hair cooks faster remember?].', 'Place soup in bowls, garnish with cilantro or use parsley.  Serve asap.', \\\"Notes: Use a Roasted Vegetable Broth. You want it dark and rich.  Add Mrs Dash seasoning [I use the Southwest but be warned it is going to spike your heat up]   Also don't use Canned as the recipe calls for.  Use fresh tomatoes diced with some chilies.  Or use Rotel if you must use canned.\\\", \\\"The recipe above is the Journal's recipe and it is a simple recipe suited to smaller childrens tastes [no hot.]  I prefer to kick it up. Seasoning is omitted because of this so you need to add it.  If you don't it is going to be a bland broth spiced only by the Roasted Vegetable broth.\\\"]\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 2.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 197.5, \"FatContent\": 4.7, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 0.7, \"CholesterolContent\": 2.4, \"SodiumContent\": 960.0, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 33.2, \"FiberContent\": 2.3, \"SugarContent\": 6.6, \"ProteinContent\": 6.2, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT0S\", \"CookTime\": \"PT15M\", \"TotalTime\": \"PT15M\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 0.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 15.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['diced tomatoes', 'onion', 'garlic cloves', 'chipotle pepper', 'canola oil', 'angel hair pasta', 'vegetable broth', 'fresh cilantro']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['diced tomatoes', 'onion', 'garlic cloves', 'chipotle pepper', 'canola oil', 'angel hair pasta', 'vegetable broth', 'fresh cilantro']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['tomato', 'onion', 'garlic', 'chipotle pepper', 'canola oil', 'angel hair pasta', 'vegetable broth', 'cilantro']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['tomato', 'onion', 'garlic', 'chipotle pepper', 'canola oil', 'angel hair pasta', 'vegetable broth', 'cilantro']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['tomato', 'onion', 'garlic', 'chipotle pepper', 'canola oil', 'angel hair pasta', 'vegetable broth', 'cilantro']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final_le_5_replace\": \"['tomato', 'onion', 'garlic', 'chipotle pepper', 'canola oil', 'angel hair pasta', 'vegetable broth', 'cilantro']\", \"EnergyFromFat\": 42.3, \"EnergyFromSaturatedFat\": 6.3, \"EnergyFromCarbs\": 132.8, \"EnergyFromProtein\": 24.8, \"SaturatedFatPercentEnergy\": 3.189873417721519, \"FatPercentEnergy\": 21.417721518987346, \"WHO_SatFat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Fat_Compliant\": true, \"WHO_Sodium_Compliant\": false, \"WHO_Score\": 2, \"WHO_Healthy\": true, \"Energy_kJ\": 826.34, \"A_score\": 13, \"C_score\": 5, \"FSA_Score\": 8, \"FSA_Healthy\": false, \"popularity_sco