t to scotch the bottom) or it can be prepared in the microwave, (my prevrence is the microwave, as I always seem to end up with a scortched saucepan bottom) Leave sit in the fridge for 1 hour to thicken and cool.', 'After 1 hour,slice the bananas into pieces.', 'Remove the dessert from the fridge; place the banana slices evenly over the cream cheese layer.', 'Gently spread the prepared pudding over the bananas.', 'Top with 2 cups (or more) Cool Whip topping.', 'Refrigerate for 2 hours before serving.', 'Note: do not replace the pudding and pie filling with instant pudding for this dessert, it will not hold up, and will run all over when the dessert is sliced.']\", \"Images\": \"[]\", \"AggregatedRating_na\": 5.0, \"ReviewCount\": 1.0, \"Calories\": 953.0, \"FatContent\": 58.1, \"SaturatedFatContent\": 38.0, \"CholesterolContent\": 127.0, \"SodiumContent\": 557.9, \"CarbohydrateContent\": 102.0, \"FiberContent\": 1.9, \"SugarContent\": 77.5, \"ProteinContent\": 11.3, \"source\": \"foodcom\", \"PrepTime\": \"PT5H\", \"CookTime\": null, \"TotalTime\": \"PT5H\", \"PrepTime_Minutes\": 300.0, \"CookTime_Minutes\": null, \"TotalTime_Minutes\": 300.0, \"RecipeIngredientParts\": \"['sugar', 'cinnamon', 'butter', 'margarine', 'cream cheese', 'icing sugar', 'bananas', 'Jello gelatin', 'half-and-half cream']\", \"RecipeIngredientParts_old\": \"['sugar', 'cinnamon', 'butter', 'margarine', 'cream cheese', 'icing sugar', 'bananas', 'Jello gelatin', 'half-and-half cream']\", \"ingredients_canonical\": \"['sugar', 'cinnamon', 'butter', 'margarine', 'cream cheese', 'powdered sugar', 'banana', 'jello gelatin', 'half and half cream']\", \"ingredients_canonical_auto\": \"['sugar', 'cinnamon', 'butter', 'margarine', 'cream cheese', 'powdered sugar', 'banana', 'jello gelatin', 'half and half cream']\", \"ingredients_canonical_final\": \"['sugar', 'cinnamon', 'butter', 'margarine', 'cream cheese', 'powdered sugar', 'banana', 'jello gelatin', 'half and half cream']\", \"ingredients_canonica